(685058, 72042, 11518, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure it was a good idea to change the colours.  I personally don''t like it, but it''s purely a question of different taste.</td>', 'I''m not sure it was a good idea to change the colours.  I personally don''t like it, but it''s purely a question of different taste.', '2004-04-26 01:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(685061, 72293, 11518, '<td valign="top">Overexposed.  You could have used fill-flash to bring out the shadows on the statue while correctly exposing the background.</td>', 'Overexposed.  You could have used fill-flash to bring out the shadows on the statue while correctly exposing the background.', '2004-04-26 01:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(685063, 72284, 6405, '<td valign="top">Looks like JmSetzlers photo,well done b/w.10 from me !</td>', 'Looks like JmSetzlers photo,well done b/w.10 from me !', '2004-04-26 01:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(685065, 71123, 11518, '<td valign="top">Great picture but somewhat overexposed.  Also this could be anywhere in the world, does not give a sense of place to show where you live.</td>', 'Great picture but somewhat overexposed.  Also this could be anywhere in the world, does not give a sense of place to show where you live.', '2004-04-26 01:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(685066, 71361, 15207, '<td valign="top">I  really like this image. I find it looks like the noise reduction was a bit too much. NOt sure if maybe it was that the shutter was open and the wind was blowing the trees for the blurr or if you used NeatImage or NoiseNinja. I find it has a really arty feel. I like it a lot, but the blur is a bit distracting. - 8</td>', 'I  really like this image. I find it looks like the noise reduction was a bit too much. NOt sure if maybe it was that the shutter was open and the wind was blowing the trees for the blurr or if you used NeatImage or NoiseNinja. I find it has a really arty feel. I like it a lot, but the blur is a bit distracting. - 8', '2004-04-26 01:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(685067, 72280, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice, but this could be any garden in the world, does not give a sense of place.</td>', 'Nice, but this could be any garden in the world, does not give a sense of place.', '2004-04-26 01:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(685069, 72270, 11518, '<td valign="top">nice composition, maybe a tad overexposed.</td>', 'nice composition, maybe a tad overexposed.', '2004-04-26 01:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(685070, 72070, 11518, '<td valign="top">Did you add text to this pic?</td>', 'Did you add text to this pic?', '2004-04-26 01:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(685073, 71761, 11518, '<td valign="top">Great pic, fanstastic depth of field.  I would have offset the mountain a little bit, it looks kinda weird bang in the middle. 8</td>', 'Great pic, fanstastic depth of field.  I would have offset the mountain a little bit, it looks kinda weird bang in the middle. 8', '2004-04-26 01:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(685075, 72223, 11518, '<td valign="top">Very good composition but unfortunately the background is overexposed, easily correctable with PS.</td>', 'Very good composition but unfortunately the background is overexposed, easily correctable with PS.', '2004-04-26 01:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(685077, 72053, 11518, '<td valign="top">Overexposed sky.</td>', 'Overexposed sky.', '2004-04-26 01:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(685079, 72119, 14986, '<td valign="top">I love the drama of the colors in this shot.  The exposure, lighting, and contrast with the clarity of focus make this one stand out.</td>', 'I love the drama of the colors in this shot.  The exposure, lighting, and contrast with the clarity of focus make this one stand out.', '2004-04-26 01:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(685080, 72141, 11518, '<td valign="top">Buildings a bit over exposed, reducing the exposure a little bit would have brought out the details.</td>', 'Buildings a bit over exposed, reducing the exposure a little bit would have brought out the details.', '2004-04-26 01:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(685085, 72234, 11518, '<td valign="top">Overexposed somewhat.  Could be any place, does not give a sense of place.</td>', 'Overexposed somewhat.  Could be any place, does not give a sense of place.', '2004-04-26 01:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(685087, 71670, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful squirrel pic but this could be my backyard, does not say Florida to me.</td>', 'Beautiful squirrel pic but this could be my backyard, does not say Florida to me.', '2004-04-26 01:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(685090, 72264, 7969, '<td valign="top">I would of cropped a bit more off the bottom, to just below the trees, but this is a great shot, way to make the lightening crackle behind 2 interesting buildings :  ).</td>', 'I would of cropped a bit more off the bottom, to just below the trees, but this is a great shot, way to make the lightening crackle behind 2 interesting buildings :  ).', '2004-04-26 01:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(685092, 72095, 11518, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field.  There seems to be a bluish colour cast, could have been better if shot early morning or just before sunset.</td>', 'Great depth of field.  There seems to be a bluish colour cast, could have been better if shot early morning or just before sunset.', '2004-04-26 01:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(685093, 71865, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice golden colors.  I don''t think the size of the post will do this photo justice.  In this smaller size it''s difficult to determine much of the detail.</td>', 'Nice golden colors.  I don''t think the size of the post will do this photo justice.  In this smaller size it''s difficult to determine much of the detail.', '2004-04-26 01:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(685097, 71935, 14986, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot of the neighborhood.</td>', 'Pretty shot of the neighborhood.', '2004-04-26 01:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(685098, 72144, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Lighting a bit harsh, middle of the day?  Early morning or dusk would have given a more interesting atmosphere.</td>', 'Nice.  Lighting a bit harsh, middle of the day?  Early morning or dusk would have given a more interesting atmosphere.', '2004-04-26 01:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(685101, 72049, 11518, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I love this building!  Maybe a tad overexposed though.</td>', 'Very nice!  I love this building!  Maybe a tad overexposed though.', '2004-04-26 01:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(685103, 72142, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like the mood of this shot.  Even the dog looks relaxed!   I like the composition, with the man and dog in the lower portion of the frame.</td>', 'I really like the mood of this shot.  Even the dog looks relaxed!   I like the composition, with the man and dog in the lower portion of the frame.', '2004-04-26 01:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(685106, 72126, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice, I would have darkened the sky a little bit.</td>', 'Nice, I would have darkened the sky a little bit.', '2004-04-26 01:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(685108, 72284, 11518, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-04-26 01:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(685110, 72135, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I''d be tempted to crop off just a little more from the bottom.  I think the darkness of the land detracts just a bit too much from the nice subtle blues of the water, hills and sky.  I''d leave some, but not quite as much.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I''d be tempted to crop off just a little more from the bottom.  I think the darkness of the land detracts just a bit too much from the nice subtle blues of the water, hills and sky.  I''d leave some, but not quite as much.', '2004-04-26 01:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(685113, 72042, 14986, '<td valign="top">Cool effect.  I''m not crazy about so much water in the foreground.</td>', 'Cool effect.  I''m not crazy about so much water in the foreground.', '2004-04-26 01:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(685115, 72138, 18194, '<td valign="top">Wow, great photo</td>', 'Wow, great photo', '2004-04-26 01:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(685117, 72253, 11518, '<td valign="top">Overexposed background.  Landscape pictures taken in the middle of the day are rarely pleasing.</td>', 'Overexposed background.  Landscape pictures taken in the middle of the day are rarely pleasing.', '2004-04-26 01:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(685118, 72164, 17148, '<td valign="top">I really like this pic, want to see more of what is to the left though, maybe a horizontal, maybe not, just curious cause I do like the pic alot</td>', 'I really like this pic, want to see more of what is to the left though, maybe a horizontal, maybe not, just curious cause I do like the pic alot', '2004-04-26 01:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(685119, 72085, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice of the bird to stop by and pose for you!  Lovely shot.   The water in the front looks a little over sharpened or something, but it''s a minor thing.  I think the composition is excellent.  I might also run it through Neat Image or the like to try to reduce some of the noise.</td>', 'Nice of the bird to stop by and pose for you!  Lovely shot.   The water in the front looks a little over sharpened or something, but it''s a minor thing.  I think the composition is excellent.  I might also run it through Neat Image or the like to try to reduce some of the noise.', '2004-04-26 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(685120, 72155, 17148, '<td valign="top">like it, wish it were bigger</td>', 'like it, wish it were bigger', '2004-04-26 01:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(685121, 72329, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice, clear shot.   I like the lighting in this one.</td>', 'Nice, clear shot.   I like the lighting in this one.', '2004-04-26 01:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(685122, 71883, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice, maybe a bit oversharpened.  A haze filter would perhaps have helped to get more definition in the background.</td>', 'Nice, maybe a bit oversharpened.  A haze filter would perhaps have helped to get more definition in the background.', '2004-04-26 01:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(685123, 71571, 11518, '<td valign="top">Could be anywhere, does not give a sense of place.</td>', 'Could be anywhere, does not give a sense of place.', '2004-04-26 01:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(685124, 71902, 11518, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a green color cast, easily removed in PS.</td>', 'There seems to be a green color cast, easily removed in PS.', '2004-04-26 01:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(685126, 72110, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice, a Polarizer would have helped make it even better.  Bluish cast can be removed in PS.</td>', 'Nice, a Polarizer would have helped make it even better.  Bluish cast can be removed in PS.', '2004-04-26 01:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(685127, 72211, 11518, '<td valign="top">A tad over exposed.</td>', 'A tad over exposed.', '2004-04-26 01:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
