(685194, 72138, 2752, '<td valign="top">great shot...looks like spring has sprung..the foreground balances the mountains nicely  and  the foothills draw my  attention to the town..well done.</td>', 'great shot...looks like spring has sprung..the foreground balances the mountains nicely  and  the foothills draw my  attention to the town..well done.', '2004-04-26 02:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
