(685208, 72072, 11518, '<td valign="top">a bit over exposed</td>', 'a bit over exposed', '2004-04-26 02:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(685221, 71871, 9668, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the blood in this image, seems too grotesque.  I do like the lighting, the blood does connect well with the backdrop. I won''t mark you down, but it could have a border, and I''m  not quite sure how well it fits the challenge. Funny idea though.</td>', 'I don''t really like the blood in this image, seems too grotesque.  I do like the lighting, the blood does connect well with the backdrop. I won''t mark you down, but it could have a border, and I''m  not quite sure how well it fits the challenge. Funny idea though.', '2004-04-26 02:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(685226, 72323, 15511, '<td valign="top">The border is a bit overbearing, should be thinner.</td>', 'The border is a bit overbearing, should be thinner.', '2004-04-26 02:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(685231, 72143, 9668, '<td valign="top">I love how well the structue stands out. Nice use of soft lighting. Door in the lower left corner is annoying, but nothing you could do. Good composition.</td>', 'I love how well the structue stands out. Nice use of soft lighting. Door in the lower left corner is annoying, but nothing you could do. Good composition.', '2004-04-26 02:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(685233, 72093, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.</td>', 'Very nice colors.', '2004-04-26 02:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(685235, 72070, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2004-04-26 02:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(685236, 72133, 6130, '<td valign="top">Funny and good.</td>', 'Funny and good.', '2004-04-26 02:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(685238, 71865, 9668, '<td valign="top">Interesting that the title isn''t capitalized, minor. Image is a soft blurred, I personally, would like it more in focus. Cool night lights. I think it could be a little bigger as well (by 40 pixels! :).  Nice border use. Through your title, you have setup a story, forever trapped up in this city or tower (princess in a tower, or prince as the case may be).</td>', 'Interesting that the title isn''t capitalized, minor. Image is a soft blurred, I personally, would like it more in focus. Cool night lights. I think it could be a little bigger as well (by 40 pixels! :).  Nice border use. Through your title, you have setup a story, forever trapped up in this city or tower (princess in a tower, or prince as the case may be).', '2004-04-26 02:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(685244, 72213, 9668, '<td valign="top">Intentional soft blur I hope. I like the sky in the background, it adds depth.  Bush on the bottom is annoying, but it is minor Nice time of day for this shot. Good job.</td>', 'Intentional soft blur I hope. I like the sky in the background, it adds depth.  Bush on the bottom is annoying, but it is minor Nice time of day for this shot. Good job.', '2004-04-26 02:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(685245, 72068, 14986, '<td valign="top">I should rate this low since you guys beat us today (after the rain!)    :)   Nice shot, but I wish it was a slightly different angle to get all of the PNC Park words in.   I really like the time of day this was taken - the lighting and contrast is nice.  It tells you something about the city, as well as showing the city in the background, <br/>which really helps it fit the challenge well.    We''ll take the final game from ya tomorrow!<br/> <br/>Looked at it closer...I think it''s Sean Casey at the plate with Adam Dunn on deck.</td>', 'I should rate this low since you guys beat us today (after the rain!)    :)   Nice shot, but I wish it was a slightly different angle to get all of the PNC Park words in.   I really like the time of day this was taken - the lighting and contrast is nice.  It tells you something about the city, as well as showing the city in the background, which really helps it fit the challenge well.    We''ll take the final game from ya tomorrow! Looked at it closer...I think it''s Sean Casey at the plate with Adam Dunn on deck.', '2004-04-26 03:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(685246, 72049, 9668, '<td valign="top">You live in the National Gallery? What? Browse for the day, then fold out a caught and sleep during the night? No. Nice image. I like how the light shows through the building.</td>', 'You live in the National Gallery? What? Browse for the day, then fold out a caught and sleep during the night? No. Nice image. I like how the light shows through the building.', '2004-04-26 03:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(685248, 71123, 70, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. Great perspective, love the wide open space of the sky and the small size of the people. Really cool.</td>', 'I love this photo. Great perspective, love the wide open space of the sky and the small size of the people. Really cool.', '2004-04-26 03:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(685250, 72284, 9668, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure how this is where you live, or evolution is where you live, but it is a superb image. Looks great in black and white, excellent technical. Love the cavern walls and the water flow. 7</td>', 'Not quite sure how this is where you live, or evolution is where you live, but it is a superb image. Looks great in black and white, excellent technical. Love the cavern walls and the water flow. 7', '2004-04-26 03:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(685252, 72300, 9668, '<td valign="top">Either it''s dinosaurs in current day or you have a a random modern building in dinosaur ages. Interesting idea. The plastic dinosaur seems a little bit dark.</td>', 'Either it''s dinosaurs in current day or you have a a random modern building in dinosaur ages. Interesting idea. The plastic dinosaur seems a little bit dark.', '2004-04-26 03:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(685255, 72187, 9668, '<td valign="top">Cool texture of the door. Stick on the bottom is annoying, minor. I don''t know why ''live'' isn''t capitalized as well in the title.</td>', 'Cool texture of the door. Stick on the bottom is annoying, minor. I don''t know why ''live'' isn''t capitalized as well in the title.', '2004-04-26 03:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
