(685487, 72170, 14603, '<td valign="top">A very graphic image..which I would like to think was posed..but regardless, it`s sadly typical of any big city.I like the way you have used the colourful graffiti<br/>to liven up the image. <br/>If this is taken by the person I`m thinking of...(I see you are taking no chances with washed out skies?)  If not..please ignore me  :)<br/>Strong image ..Powerful message....8</td>', 'A very graphic image..which I would like to think was posed..but regardless, it`s sadly typical of any big city.I like the way you have used the colourful graffitito liven up the image. If this is taken by the person I`m thinking of...(I see you are taking no chances with washed out skies?)  If not..please ignore me  :)Strong image ..Powerful message....8', '2004-04-26 09:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(685488, 72120, 7754, '<td valign="top">Þetta er sérlega glæsileg mynd og nafnið er sérdeilis vel til fundið ;)<br/>Búin að skoða hinar myndirnar og finnst ekki mikið varið í margar þeirra, einstaka er mjög góð - reyndar hef ég EKKERT vit á þessu. Get bara sagt hvað mér finnst.<br/>Gangi þér vel ;)</td>', 'Þetta er sérlega glæsileg mynd og nafnið er sérdeilis vel til fundið ;)Búin að skoða hinar myndirnar og finnst ekki mikið varið í margar þeirra, einstaka er mjög góð - reyndar hef ég EKKERT vit á þessu. Get bara sagt hvað mér finnst.Gangi þér vel ;)', '2004-04-26 09:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(685489, 71728, 7754, '<td valign="top">Vá...</td>', 'Vá...', '2004-04-26 09:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(685491, 72093, 14603, '<td valign="top">Great picture..Personally, I would have preferred if you had gone for the water rather than the sky for the bulk of your picture..but good work nonetheless</td>', 'Great picture..Personally, I would have preferred if you had gone for the water rather than the sky for the bulk of your picture..but good work nonetheless', '2004-04-26 09:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(685496, 71259, 9913, '<td valign="top">cant see your town there?</td>', 'cant see your town there?', '2004-04-26 09:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(685499, 71993, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very well composed image with high contrast mid ground and  low contrast foreground &amp; background which gives the feeling of sunlight illuminating the subject.</td>', 'Very well composed image with high contrast mid ground and  low contrast foreground & background which gives the feeling of sunlight illuminating the subject.', '2004-04-26 09:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(685506, 72119, 9913, '<td valign="top">hmmmm let me think .............ok You´ll get a 10 ;-)</td>', 'hmmmm let me think .............ok You´ll get a 10 ;-)', '2004-04-26 09:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(685507, 72336, 14603, '<td valign="top">Lucky person !<br/>Nice image ..well composed<br/> <br/></td>', 'Lucky person !Nice image ..well composed ', '2004-04-26 09:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(685513, 72110, 14603, '<td valign="top">I`ve never visited the Carmarthen bay area but judging from your image..maybe I should. Nice bit of "Serendipity" with the seagull   :)<br/>Good work</td>', 'I`ve never visited the Carmarthen bay area but judging from your image..maybe I should. Nice bit of "Serendipity" with the seagull   :)Good work', '2004-04-26 09:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(685524, 72331, 14603, '<td valign="top">Great image..fantastic clarity and wonderful colour..the little bit of red in the flag and the yellow wheel add so much to the overall picture.<br/>Don`t know how you will fare...bearing in mind that a lot of voters will be looking for conventional building shots..but I hope it scores well....9</td>', 'Great image..fantastic clarity and wonderful colour..the little bit of red in the flag and the yellow wheel add so much to the overall picture.Don`t know how you will fare...bearing in mind that a lot of voters will be looking for conventional building shots..but I hope it scores well....9', '2004-04-26 09:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(685528, 71957, 8139, '<td valign="top">My first 10 so far. Bravo. Looks unreal.</td>', 'My first 10 so far. Bravo. Looks unreal.', '2004-04-26 09:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(685530, 72338, 14603, '<td valign="top">Great image...a classic example of how selective desat can enhance a picture....9</td>', 'Great image...a classic example of how selective desat can enhance a picture....9', '2004-04-26 09:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(685532, 72260, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured</td>', 'Nicely captured', '2004-04-26 09:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(685533, 72099, 19446, '<td valign="top">Not bad, this picture really portrays a sense of vastness and openness.  The only thing I''m not 100% fond of is that the horse &amp; tree are more of the subject than the town.  But not that I said that, my entry doesn''t really focus on the town either.  7.</td>', 'Not bad, this picture really portrays a sense of vastness and openness.  The only thing I''m not 100% fond of is that the horse & tree are more of the subject than the town.  But not that I said that, my entry doesn''t really focus on the town either.  7.', '2004-04-26 09:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(685536, 71927, 19446, '<td valign="top">very nice, I love the way the color of the flowers match the woman''s hat, it ties the scene together very well.</td>', 'very nice, I love the way the color of the flowers match the woman''s hat, it ties the scene together very well.', '2004-04-26 09:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(685563, 72338, 16004, '<td valign="top">There''s something undeniably lovely about old fashioned mail boxes - is the one left in colour yours?  The overall depth of field and focus on the coloured box to me looks totally spot on.  This is certainly a viable hung on the wall picture, and no mistake.  Well done you!  10.</td>', 'There''s something undeniably lovely about old fashioned mail boxes - is the one left in colour yours?  The overall depth of field and focus on the coloured box to me looks totally spot on.  This is certainly a viable hung on the wall picture, and no mistake.  Well done you!  10.', '2004-04-26 10:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(685564, 72068, 12362, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, I really hope you get a ribbon for this one, Pitt is the most beautiful city in the United States. Good Luck!</td>', 'Beautiful, I really hope you get a ribbon for this one, Pitt is the most beautiful city in the United States. Good Luck!', '2004-04-26 10:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(685567, 72141, 15129, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors--I especially love the reflections and the sky tones.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors--I especially love the reflections and the sky tones.', '2004-04-26 10:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(685571, 72094, 15129, '<td valign="top">Cool idea and perspective. What doesn''t work for me (and this is just me) is the clipping of the foreground building and background mountains. Was there another way to frame it? But then, again, this might have been the result you wanted.</td>', 'Cool idea and perspective. What doesn''t work for me (and this is just me) is the clipping of the foreground building and background mountains. Was there another way to frame it? But then, again, this might have been the result you wanted.', '2004-04-26 10:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(685572, 72264, 14603, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture and great exposure...9</td>', 'Excellent capture and great exposure...9', '2004-04-26 10:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(685573, 71240, 14603, '<td valign="top">Really like the exposure and clarity of this image..8</td>', 'Really like the exposure and clarity of this image..8', '2004-04-26 10:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(685574, 72242, 15129, '<td valign="top">Neat, except for the over exposure in the foliage in the lower right and upper left.</td>', 'Neat, except for the over exposure in the foliage in the lower right and upper left.', '2004-04-26 10:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(685575, 71365, 15129, '<td valign="top">Brightening up up foreground might be an interesting experiment</td>', 'Brightening up up foreground might be an interesting experiment', '2004-04-26 10:45:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(685576, 72042, 13610, '<td valign="top">I know my coment may sound cliche but it look too much like digital art to me. (3)</td>', 'I know my coment may sound cliche but it look too much like digital art to me. (3)', '2004-04-26 10:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(685578, 72165, 15129, '<td valign="top">Did you use a tripod--it seems there was either camera shake or a lack of careful (and planned) focus. The eye bounces back and forth between the purple in the trees and the house in the lower right background.</td>', 'Did you use a tripod--it seems there was either camera shake or a lack of careful (and planned) focus. The eye bounces back and forth between the purple in the trees and the house in the lower right background.', '2004-04-26 10:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(685579, 72300, 15129, '<td valign="top">It seems (IMHO) underexposed--in regard to the dinosaur especially. A lot of what must be neat detail in the dino is lost. Cool idea, though.</td>', 'It seems (IMHO) underexposed--in regard to the dinosaur especially. A lot of what must be neat detail in the dino is lost. Cool idea, though.', '2004-04-26 10:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(685580, 71927, 15129, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Good luck.</td>', 'Stunning. Good luck.', '2004-04-26 10:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(685581, 72257, 15129, '<td valign="top">This is outstanding! Good luck.</td>', 'This is outstanding! Good luck.', '2004-04-26 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(685582, 72260, 15129, '<td valign="top">Very evocative. Good luck.</td>', 'Very evocative. Good luck.', '2004-04-26 10:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(685584, 71634, 3599, '<td valign="top">New York?!  I don''t think so.  You have a nice photo here.  But I feel like you are being misleading with the title.  People who don''t know baseball or even non-Americans will think this is New York when it actually isn''t.  Like I said nice picture.  I''m giving you a 7 for the photo, would have been higher if not for the misleading title.</td>', 'New York?!  I don''t think so.  You have a nice photo here.  But I feel like you are being misleading with the title.  People who don''t know baseball or even non-Americans will think this is New York when it actually isn''t.  Like I said nice picture.  I''m giving you a 7 for the photo, would have been higher if not for the misleading title.', '2004-04-26 10:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(685586, 72310, 14603, '<td valign="top">My era...Rock on Sgt Pepper.....7</td>', 'My era...Rock on Sgt Pepper.....7', '2004-04-26 10:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(685592, 72170, 12802, '<td valign="top">It''s funny how this is never shown in the promo videos for Glasgow...  Certain parts of Edinburgh aren''t much better!  Still, they can make great photographs!</td>', 'It''s funny how this is never shown in the promo videos for Glasgow...  Certain parts of Edinburgh aren''t much better!  Still, they can make great photographs!', '2004-04-26 10:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(685594, 72335, 14603, '<td valign="top">The low cloud and green reflection on the water make this image special.<br/>Good work</td>', 'The low cloud and green reflection on the water make this image special.Good work', '2004-04-26 11:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(685596, 71365, 327, '<td valign="top">Autumn? The colors are very nice and the view is beautiful there. I like the composition, hope you do well.</td>', 'Autumn? The colors are very nice and the view is beautiful there. I like the composition, hope you do well.', '2004-04-26 11:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(685597, 72072, 14603, '<td valign="top">Gives you a real feel for the city..great exposure.</td>', 'Gives you a real feel for the city..great exposure.', '2004-04-26 11:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(685598, 71571, 327, '<td valign="top">Not very much here to hold my attention. The buds/flowers are oof but I think your idea and composition was okay.</td>', 'Not very much here to hold my attention. The buds/flowers are oof but I think your idea and composition was okay.', '2004-04-26 11:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(685599, 72206, 327, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice area. Did you do the desaturation intentionally? It looks a little too pale to me. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like a nice area. Did you do the desaturation intentionally? It looks a little too pale to me. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-04-26 11:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(685601, 72177, 327, '<td valign="top">No idea where this is, but it is packed in! Large buildings with lots of colors. Neat view. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'No idea where this is, but it is packed in! Large buildings with lots of colors. Neat view. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-04-26 11:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(685602, 71703, 327, '<td valign="top">Little bit over exposed. kiwi...lol</td>', 'Little bit over exposed. kiwi...lol', '2004-04-26 11:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(685605, 72053, 327, '<td valign="top">Blown out sky or maybe a foggy morning. Looks like fun, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Blown out sky or maybe a foggy morning. Looks like fun, good luck in the challenge.', '2004-04-26 11:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(685609, 72093, 13610, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I plan to do almost the same shot someday from somewhere on the side of the 132. Some few comment: Your photo seem to have been shot at wide angle because there is an obvious distortion in your shot. you can see the river rolling up in the right of your photo. The image seem tilted too like the camera was inclined on the left side. Your sky is beautiful, you had a good light but it seem your camera was pointed slightly to the sky because it gives the impression that the building are bent over their backside. if you ever do that photo again, my advice is don''t zoom out all the way to the wide angle side, point the camera at level and be carefull no to be tilted.</td>', 'Great shot. I plan to do almost the same shot someday from somewhere on the side of the 132. Some few comment: Your photo seem to have been shot at wide angle because there is an obvious distortion in your shot. you can see the river rolling up in the right of your photo. The image seem tilted too like the camera was inclined on the left side. Your sky is beautiful, you had a good light but it seem your camera was pointed slightly to the sky because it gives the impression that the building are bent over their backside. if you ever do that photo again, my advice is don''t zoom out all the way to the wide angle side, point the camera at level and be carefull no to be tilted.', '2004-04-26 11:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(685610, 72247, 13610, '<td valign="top">really interesting point of view</td>', 'really interesting point of view', '2004-04-26 11:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(685613, 72250, 13610, '<td valign="top">I can''t find a clear subject in your photo, and it seems out of focus.</td>', 'I can''t find a clear subject in your photo, and it seems out of focus.', '2004-04-26 11:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(685616, 71672, 13610, '<td valign="top">Is it where you live? or are these tower tourism worthy?</td>', 'Is it where you live? or are these tower tourism worthy?', '2004-04-26 11:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
