(685763, 72336, 15207, '<td valign="top">If you don''t win the blue ribbon I''ll be surprised. This one is perfect. - 10</td>', 'If you don''t win the blue ribbon I''ll be surprised. This one is perfect. - 10', '2004-04-26 13:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(685765, 71240, 15207, '<td valign="top">My pick for a ribbon! - 10</td>', 'My pick for a ribbon! - 10', '2004-04-26 13:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(685766, 72230, 15207, '<td valign="top">One of my top three favorites in this challenge. - 10</td>', 'One of my top three favorites in this challenge. - 10', '2004-04-26 13:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(685768, 72294, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really funny. I love it. My only suggestion is that it lokos like the cars were blurred out in post-processing. It looks  alittle funny. I''m not very adept in PS myself so I''m not sure how to correct it. Sometimes you can use several layers and gausian blur to blur the background to give your subject more DOf. I think there may be a tutorial on this on the site. But, overall, I really like it. The fire hydrant really stands out. Too many images in this challenge have no real point of interest or subject to draw the eye - 8.</td>', 'Really funny. I love it. My only suggestion is that it lokos like the cars were blurred out in post-processing. It looks  alittle funny. I''m not very adept in PS myself so I''m not sure how to correct it. Sometimes you can use several layers and gausian blur to blur the background to give your subject more DOf. I think there may be a tutorial on this on the site. But, overall, I really like it. The fire hydrant really stands out. Too many images in this challenge have no real point of interest or subject to draw the eye - 8.', '2004-04-26 13:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
