(685816, 71907, 5391, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty.  I''d love to see those tiny lights just a *touch* sharper, but your exposure is beautiful.  The sky is a gorgeous blend of blues.</td>', 'This is very pretty.  I''d love to see those tiny lights just a *touch* sharper, but your exposure is beautiful.  The sky is a gorgeous blend of blues.', '2004-04-26 13:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(685819, 72280, 5391, '<td valign="top">Good job at finding an interesting perspective to take this shot from.  The only things that bother me are the closest tulip being cut off at the edge of the frame and the blown out white spots on the lighter colored tulips.  That could possibly have been fixed by taking it during early morning light that wasn''t so contrasty.</td>', 'Good job at finding an interesting perspective to take this shot from.  The only things that bother me are the closest tulip being cut off at the edge of the frame and the blown out white spots on the lighter colored tulips.  That could possibly have been fixed by taking it during early morning light that wasn''t so contrasty.', '2004-04-26 13:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(685820, 72120, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very creative angle, gorgeous sky and good use of a wide-angle lens.  I''m bothered a bit by the shadow on the building in the lower part of the image, but I know if you cropped it, it would ruin the composition and mean cutting out part of the cross.  Perhaps taking it at a slightly different time of day would have helped?  Still, nicely done, nonetheless.</td>', 'Very creative angle, gorgeous sky and good use of a wide-angle lens.  I''m bothered a bit by the shadow on the building in the lower part of the image, but I know if you cropped it, it would ruin the composition and mean cutting out part of the cross.  Perhaps taking it at a slightly different time of day would have helped?  Still, nicely done, nonetheless.', '2004-04-26 13:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(685821, 72262, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I like the flowers as an anchor, and then the path that leads your eye through the image.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I like the flowers as an anchor, and then the path that leads your eye through the image.', '2004-04-26 13:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(685825, 72177, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful view.  I might have cropped the image to make it even more panoramic - just above the hills in the background.  The sky is not very interesting, and that would really keep the viewer''s eye on those beautiful buildings in the front row.</td>', 'Beautiful view.  I might have cropped the image to make it even more panoramic - just above the hills in the background.  The sky is not very interesting, and that would really keep the viewer''s eye on those beautiful buildings in the front row.', '2004-04-26 13:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(685826, 71482, 5391, '<td valign="top">Lovely village and beautiful reflections captured in the water.  I held my hand over the picture to cover the foliage on the left completely, and I think perhaps the shot is stronger that way.  It''s that awkward time of spring right now where you have lots of beautiful color, but also bare branches on trees that aren''t in bloom yet.  The empty branches add a feeling of isolation to an otherwise warm and cheerful image.</td>', 'Lovely village and beautiful reflections captured in the water.  I held my hand over the picture to cover the foliage on the left completely, and I think perhaps the shot is stronger that way.  It''s that awkward time of spring right now where you have lots of beautiful color, but also bare branches on trees that aren''t in bloom yet.  The empty branches add a feeling of isolation to an otherwise warm and cheerful image.', '2004-04-26 13:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(685827, 72232, 5391, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  Great foreground detail captured by your wide-angle lens, and the colors are lovely.  I predict a ribbon in your future, or very close.  :)</td>', 'Gorgeous.  Great foreground detail captured by your wide-angle lens, and the colors are lovely.  I predict a ribbon in your future, or very close.  :)', '2004-04-26 13:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(685829, 71993, 5391, '<td valign="top">Oh, my!  Lovely shot!  There seems to be a bit of haze in the air that keeps the saturated colors of the foliage from being all it could be, but your composition is beautiful, and I love the inclusion of the foreground.</td>', 'Oh, my!  Lovely shot!  There seems to be a bit of haze in the air that keeps the saturated colors of the foliage from being all it could be, but your composition is beautiful, and I love the inclusion of the foreground.', '2004-04-26 13:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(685849, 71991, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, and the grain does add to the overall "sense and feel" of the picture.  Maybe more of sepia tone instead of black/white would have been more effective.</td>', 'I like the composition, and the grain does add to the overall "sense and feel" of the picture.  Maybe more of sepia tone instead of black/white would have been more effective.', '2004-04-26 13:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
