(686056, 72166, 327, '<td valign="top">Not a doubt this is a beautiful area....lake/river? I do wish the ramp/dock wasn''t centered in the shot. Pretty just the same.</td>', 'Not a doubt this is a beautiful area....lake/river? I do wish the ramp/dock wasn''t centered in the shot. Pretty just the same.', '2004-04-26 15:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(686057, 72322, 6597, '<td valign="top">nice reflection 6</td>', 'nice reflection 6', '2004-04-26 15:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(686060, 72002, 18958, '<td valign="top">Mix of boat and town is just great... i like all the vertical lines... and what about the color... amazing</td>', 'Mix of boat and town is just great... i like all the vertical lines... and what about the color... amazing', '2004-04-26 15:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(686062, 72254, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice looking sail boats. Lots of work but worth it. I think this shot is just too busy. Log in the water, boats, grass, heron, masts and the dock.</td>', 'Nice looking sail boats. Lots of work but worth it. I think this shot is just too busy. Log in the water, boats, grass, heron, masts and the dock.', '2004-04-26 15:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(686063, 71978, 6597, '<td valign="top">don''t see any sign of a town and etc sorry 4</td>', 'don''t see any sign of a town and etc sorry 4', '2004-04-26 15:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(686064, 72106, 11895, '<td valign="top">may have looked better at another time of day when the flowers were getting direct sunlight, I wish your crop had left a bit more room at the top</td>', 'may have looked better at another time of day when the flowers were getting direct sunlight, I wish your crop had left a bit more room at the top', '2004-04-26 15:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(686065, 71958, 3087, '<td valign="top">Two things I notice straight away. <br/>Softness (of focus?) and poor composition.<br/>In terms of composition, there seems to be no balance within the frame. What is the main focal point - is it that pole, the signage on the left, the frontage of the building of the right? The pole and the overall image feels tilted and the top of the pole dissects the frame and the sky, breaking what flow there was from the left to the right. I just can''t find a place for the eye to settle. <br/>I like the black and white with sepia toning to place the buildings in time.<br/>I wonder if other viewpoints would have provided a more aesthetically pleasing image.</td>', 'Two things I notice straight away. Softness (of focus?) and poor composition.In terms of composition, there seems to be no balance within the frame. What is the main focal point - is it that pole, the signage on the left, the frontage of the building of the right? The pole and the overall image feels tilted and the top of the pole dissects the frame and the sky, breaking what flow there was from the left to the right. I just can''t find a place for the eye to settle. I like the black and white with sepia toning to place the buildings in time.I wonder if other viewpoints would have provided a more aesthetically pleasing image.', '2004-04-26 15:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(686066, 72119, 18958, '<td valign="top">Clouds and light amazing.... look like it been blue screen and remplace in photoshop... having been there at just the right time is amazing</td>', 'Clouds and light amazing.... look like it been blue screen and remplace in photoshop... having been there at just the right time is amazing', '2004-04-26 15:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(686067, 72268, 327, '<td valign="top">I think the rail cuts this shot in half. It''s pretty dark and then the sun glare on the water. Maybe without the rail? Looks like a great area..wow.</td>', 'I think the rail cuts this shot in half. It''s pretty dark and then the sun glare on the water. Maybe without the rail? Looks like a great area..wow.', '2004-04-26 15:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(686068, 72141, 18958, '<td valign="top">Photography is the way to cath light... what a good example of that ! , nice</td>', 'Photography is the way to cath light... what a good example of that ! , nice', '2004-04-26 15:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(686070, 72051, 327, '<td valign="top">IMHO: Just doesn''t show me a postcard view of where you live....the shot it''s self is good, but wrong challenge. :(</td>', 'IMHO: Just doesn''t show me a postcard view of where you live....the shot it''s self is good, but wrong challenge. :(', '2004-04-26 15:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(686071, 72315, 3087, '<td valign="top">The richness of colours and of the black is wonderful as is the unusual length of the light reflections. Composition/ crop works well.</td>', 'The richness of colours and of the black is wonderful as is the unusual length of the light reflections. Composition/ crop works well.', '2004-04-26 15:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
