(686075, 72037, 327, '<td valign="top">If this represents where you live......then you have lots of action around you. :) The shot is very good....very good focus, light, color!! Neat shooting! Congrats on a good photo.</td>', 'If this represents where you live......then you have lots of action around you. :) The shot is very good....very good focus, light, color!! Neat shooting! Congrats on a good photo.', '2004-04-26 15:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
