(686089, 72335, 327, '<td valign="top">Deer Island....there are many around the US and I would guess the world. Nice shot, love the deep saturation here.</td>', 'Deer Island....there are many around the US and I would guess the world. Nice shot, love the deep saturation here.', '2004-04-26 15:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
