(686154, 71939, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, even though the lights are blown out..<br/> <br/>I would have liked to see this one in color also...</td>', 'Nice photo, even though the lights are blown out.. I would have liked to see this one in color also...', '2004-04-26 16:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(686155, 72266, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow -- this would be an interesting entry for the "proportion" challenge, too.  At first glance, those buildings look like they''re about 3 feet tall.  That''s quite a spot!</td>', 'Wow -- this would be an interesting entry for the "proportion" challenge, too.  At first glance, those buildings look like they''re about 3 feet tall.  That''s quite a spot!', '2004-04-26 16:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
