(686157, 72093, 5391, '<td valign="top">Lovely photograph and good use of the wide-angle lens to bring out that sky and add depth.  I find it disturbing to my eyes that the "vertical center" seems to not be in the actual center of the photograph, but in line with the taller middle building, making the right side of the image "lean in" more than the left.</td>', 'Lovely photograph and good use of the wide-angle lens to bring out that sky and add depth.  I find it disturbing to my eyes that the "vertical center" seems to not be in the actual center of the photograph, but in line with the taller middle building, making the right side of the image "lean in" more than the left.', '2004-04-26 16:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(686158, 72042, 3102, '<td valign="top">Is this near a nuclear power plant...?  :)<br/> <br/>I''m not sure I''m fond of the effects here.  I''m not sure I understand the point behind them (I feel there should be a *point* to doing something like that).</td>', 'Is this near a nuclear power plant...?  :) I''m not sure I''m fond of the effects here.  I''m not sure I understand the point behind them (I feel there should be a *point* to doing something like that).', '2004-04-26 16:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(686159, 71670, 3102, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot, although it doesn''t strike me as being strong on the challenge topic.</td>', 'A very nice shot, although it doesn''t strike me as being strong on the challenge topic.', '2004-04-26 16:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(686161, 72170, 11895, '<td valign="top">looks over-saturated</td>', 'looks over-saturated', '2004-04-26 16:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(686163, 72266, 5391, '<td valign="top">The scale of this picture seems really bizarre to me.  Are those miniature objects, or life size?  If life size, you must have used a telephoto lens of some sort to make the mountain in back of them really loom above and look large?  My eyes can''t seem to get a handle on this picture.  The building on the hill in the back certainly seems small, yet it seems larger than many of the smaller objects in the foreground.</td>', 'The scale of this picture seems really bizarre to me.  Are those miniature objects, or life size?  If life size, you must have used a telephoto lens of some sort to make the mountain in back of them really loom above and look large?  My eyes can''t seem to get a handle on this picture.  The building on the hill in the back certainly seems small, yet it seems larger than many of the smaller objects in the foreground.', '2004-04-26 16:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(686164, 71927, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot, framed nicely.  I like how the colors work together and the msity feel of the fountain that adds to the atmosphere of the whole image.</td>', 'Very pretty shot, framed nicely.  I like how the colors work together and the msity feel of the fountain that adds to the atmosphere of the whole image.', '2004-04-26 16:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
