(686183, 71124, 3102, '<td valign="top">Stunning!  The reflection is great... the exposure is great... it''s great!  A 10 from me.</td>', 'Stunning!  The reflection is great... the exposure is great... it''s great!  A 10 from me.', '2004-04-26 16:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
