(686208, 72139, 4008, '<td valign="top">I thought it would be impossible not to meet the challenge, but you are getting close. Nevertheless, a creative choice to make the flower sharp and colorful and the child B&amp;W and out of focus. But I don''t like image with partial desaturation. Sorry not appealing to me.</td>', 'I thought it would be impossible not to meet the challenge, but you are getting close. Nevertheless, a creative choice to make the flower sharp and colorful and the child B&W and out of focus. But I don''t like image with partial desaturation. Sorry not appealing to me.', '2004-04-26 17:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(686215, 71361, 5391, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, excellent use of the foreground tree to frame the shot.  I just wish the sky were a brilliant blue with lots of puffy clouds, reflected in the water...  But you did a wonderful job with what you had to work with.  A very peaceful, serene image.</td>', 'Nice lighting, excellent use of the foreground tree to frame the shot.  I just wish the sky were a brilliant blue with lots of puffy clouds, reflected in the water...  But you did a wonderful job with what you had to work with.  A very peaceful, serene image.', '2004-04-26 17:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(686219, 71672, 5391, '<td valign="top">Positively gorgeous shot.  I love the sun flare that adds life to the cold building exteriors and the diagonal you''ve captured makes this a very dynamic image.  Great work!  9</td>', 'Positively gorgeous shot.  I love the sun flare that adds life to the cold building exteriors and the diagonal you''ve captured makes this a very dynamic image.  Great work!  9', '2004-04-26 17:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
