(686236, 72284, 5391, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped this just above the large white blown out spot at the bottom right.  Then it would have been perfect.  As it is, that spot is a major distraction.  Aside from that, this canyon is just gorgeous, and your use of black and white works really well.</td>', 'I would have cropped this just above the large white blown out spot at the bottom right.  Then it would have been perfect.  As it is, that spot is a major distraction.  Aside from that, this canyon is just gorgeous, and your use of black and white works really well.', '2004-04-26 17:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
