(686353, 71573, 6999, '<td valign="top">Competent shot .. perhapslackig in drama, despite that sky. It may only be the absolute cleanliness of that shoreline, but this has the feel of man-made territory, but the look of a supposed wilderness too - I think that contrast hurts the shot. composition pulls the eye in two drections - both up and down at the same time, which lends a feeling of unease: there''s a reason the ''experts'' suggest not putting the skyline on the centre-line of the shot ... :-)</td>', 'Competent shot .. perhapslackig in drama, despite that sky. It may only be the absolute cleanliness of that shoreline, but this has the feel of man-made territory, but the look of a supposed wilderness too - I think that contrast hurts the shot. composition pulls the eye in two drections - both up and down at the same time, which lends a feeling of unease: there''s a reason the ''experts'' suggest not putting the skyline on the centre-line of the shot ... :-)', '2004-04-26 20:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
