(686369, 71967, 19608, '<td valign="top">Composition works but I''m not sure what you are telling me.  Sky is too hot.</td>', 'Composition works but I''m not sure what you are telling me.  Sky is too hot.', '2004-04-26 20:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(686370, 72001, 3607, '<td valign="top">i like the composition with the bit of man made stuff in the lower left corner.  i''m wondering if there was something you could have done to have brought out the blue in the sky a bit more . . .</td>', 'i like the composition with the bit of man made stuff in the lower left corner.  i''m wondering if there was something you could have done to have brought out the blue in the sky a bit more . . .', '2004-04-26 20:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(686371, 72262, 6999, '<td valign="top">Several strong compositional elements are let down because of a lack of a real subject: the shape, curve and lines of that parade of shops lead the eye to an area where there''s nothing much going on - just pavement. Something happening at the junction of those two paths would make this shot, and make the foreground elements so much more impactful besides. Perhaps some work on the tones or the contrast would add effect as it stands, but colour-wise and light-wise this doesn''t grab me.</td>', 'Several strong compositional elements are let down because of a lack of a real subject: the shape, curve and lines of that parade of shops lead the eye to an area where there''s nothing much going on - just pavement. Something happening at the junction of those two paths would make this shot, and make the foreground elements so much more impactful besides. Perhaps some work on the tones or the contrast would add effect as it stands, but colour-wise and light-wise this doesn''t grab me.', '2004-04-26 20:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(686372, 72068, 3607, '<td valign="top">very nice shot.  you might have walked over a bit so you would have still gotten the game and the skyline, but not the net behind the plate.</td>', 'very nice shot.  you might have walked over a bit so you would have still gotten the game and the skyline, but not the net behind the plate.', '2004-04-26 20:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(686374, 72315, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflection.  Composition works well.  Try the same shot a bit earlier in the evening - you may get a nice bluish sky which would add a point from me.</td>', 'Very nice reflection.  Composition works well.  Try the same shot a bit earlier in the evening - you may get a nice bluish sky which would add a point from me.', '2004-04-26 20:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(686376, 72144, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - placement of the white cloud is effective.</td>', 'Nice composition - placement of the white cloud is effective.', '2004-04-26 20:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(686377, 72339, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice capture of the mountains and  the buildings, although it comes across a bit muted (overcast)</td>', 'nice capture of the mountains and  the buildings, although it comes across a bit muted (overcast)', '2004-04-26 20:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(686378, 72119, 19608, '<td valign="top">Moody image - very nice colors and feel.</td>', 'Moody image - very nice colors and feel.', '2004-04-26 20:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(686381, 71976, 19608, '<td valign="top">Pastoral feeling.  The people add scale and are well positioned.</td>', 'Pastoral feeling.  The people add scale and are well positioned.', '2004-04-26 20:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(686382, 71883, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice water and moutains.  i like that the lighthouse is getting hit with the sun on its forward face.</td>', 'nice water and moutains.  i like that the lighthouse is getting hit with the sun on its forward face.', '2004-04-26 20:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(686384, 72280, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Tulips are great this time of year.  It is a bit busy.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Tulips are great this time of year.  It is a bit busy.', '2004-04-26 20:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(686386, 72087, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice light on the water and capture of the coming dusk..</td>', 'nice light on the water and capture of the coming dusk..', '2004-04-26 20:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(686387, 72034, 6999, '<td valign="top">The selective de-saturation adds impact to the fake look of the brick-work, especially with the faux-georgian/palladian pediment on the doorway. The cheesy garland just re-inforces that impact. The overly-perfect bpointing, allied to the overly clean lines and maintenance of the scene speak of an obsession with appearance to the exclusion of historical accuracy, or perhaps a simple ignorance of it. Affecting shot, in those senses; lacking in a sense of contrast - nothing to re0inforce that message, or to make your real message clear if my assessment is wrong.</td>', 'The selective de-saturation adds impact to the fake look of the brick-work, especially with the faux-georgian/palladian pediment on the doorway. The cheesy garland just re-inforces that impact. The overly-perfect bpointing, allied to the overly clean lines and maintenance of the scene speak of an obsession with appearance to the exclusion of historical accuracy, or perhaps a simple ignorance of it. Affecting shot, in those senses; lacking in a sense of contrast - nothing to re0inforce that message, or to make your real message clear if my assessment is wrong.', '2004-04-26 20:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(686389, 72138, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice colors but they would pop even more if you had used a graduated Neutral Density filter.  As is, the sky is over-exposed while the valley is underexposed.  Mountains appear about right.  Looks like a great place to call home!</td>', 'Nice colors but they would pop even more if you had used a graduated Neutral Density filter.  As is, the sky is over-exposed while the valley is underexposed.  Mountains appear about right.  Looks like a great place to call home!', '2004-04-26 20:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(686390, 71672, 3607, '<td valign="top">very neat photo - i reached for my sunglasses.</td>', 'very neat photo - i reached for my sunglasses.', '2004-04-26 20:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(686391, 72314, 19608, '<td valign="top">Good title, nice capture.  Photographically the overexposed white areas on the left cost you a couple points.</td>', 'Good title, nice capture.  Photographically the overexposed white areas on the left cost you a couple points.', '2004-04-26 20:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(686393, 72042, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - interesting concept.  The black and white buildings with the red work well, but do seem a bit "unnatural."</td>', 'Nice capture - interesting concept.  The black and white buildings with the red work well, but do seem a bit "unnatural."', '2004-04-26 20:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(686396, 71728, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp image - sharp as a tack.  The reflection is great - the wind and water was really your friend.  The hint of the dark blue in the sky adds a great touch - just the right time of day.  One minor annoyance - the merger with the bottom of the fram with the light.</td>', 'Nice crisp image - sharp as a tack.  The reflection is great - the wind and water was really your friend.  The hint of the dark blue in the sky adds a great touch - just the right time of day.  One minor annoyance - the merger with the bottom of the fram with the light.', '2004-04-26 20:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(686397, 72126, 6999, '<td valign="top">Ha ha. Don''t believe you! Entirely beside he point, of course :-) i mean, where the hell do you get your interent comection? Wonderful guidebook photograph, just perhaps lacking in a little impact of light. Whilst it''s a v=beautiful, almost painterly moment, I think perhaps the contrast could have been pushed to take it out of the realm of the ''straight-from-the-camera'' and into that of the exhibition a little more. This almost has the feeling of cut from a holiday brochure, which isn''t what I''m looking for here. Wonderful compositionally, especially that point of view, however. And there is a subtleytly to the light as you have used it that is rather pleasing. Wonderfully serene sky, too - all in all, a marvellous moment. One of our Scots friends?</td>', 'Ha ha. Don''t believe you! Entirely beside he point, of course :-) i mean, where the hell do you get your interent comection? Wonderful guidebook photograph, just perhaps lacking in a little impact of light. Whilst it''s a v=beautiful, almost painterly moment, I think perhaps the contrast could have been pushed to take it out of the realm of the ''straight-from-the-camera'' and into that of the exhibition a little more. This almost has the feeling of cut from a holiday brochure, which isn''t what I''m looking for here. Wonderful compositionally, especially that point of view, however. And there is a subtleytly to the light as you have used it that is rather pleasing. Wonderfully serene sky, too - all in all, a marvellous moment. One of our Scots friends?', '2004-04-26 20:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(686398, 71123, 19608, '<td valign="top">GREAT sky and use of the negative space.  The brown sand, blue water and the sky all work to make this an excellent image.  I would rate it even higher if the people were not so centered.</td>', 'GREAT sky and use of the negative space.  The brown sand, blue water and the sky all work to make this an excellent image.  I would rate it even higher if the people were not so centered.', '2004-04-26 20:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(686399, 72336, 3607, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot with great colors and shadows.</td>', 'wonderful shot with great colors and shadows.', '2004-04-26 20:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(686400, 71993, 3607, '<td valign="top">very nicely done with the flowers in the forefront and the church steeple (slightly left leaning?) and forested hills.</td>', 'very nicely done with the flowers in the forefront and the church steeple (slightly left leaning?) and forested hills.', '2004-04-26 20:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(686401, 72093, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and use of the image space.  Colors very pleasing and saturated. Looks like there is a small keystoning effect which is unfortunate.</td>', 'Very nice composition and use of the image space.  Colors very pleasing and saturated. Looks like there is a small keystoning effect which is unfortunate.', '2004-04-26 20:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(686402, 72133, 3607, '<td valign="top">i guess we know where to send you a letter now ;-)  nice use of b&amp;w, perhaps too little sky?</td>', 'i guess we know where to send you a letter now ;-)  nice use of b&w, perhaps too little sky?', '2004-04-26 20:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
