(686405, 71123, 3607, '<td valign="top">perhaps a bit too much sky, but i like the concept and composition very much.  colors seem almost too snapshot-ish, a problem i have sometimes and don''t know how to get over.</td>', 'perhaps a bit too much sky, but i like the concept and composition very much.  colors seem almost too snapshot-ish, a problem i have sometimes and don''t know how to get over.', '2004-04-26 20:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
