(686415, 71811, 3607, '<td valign="top">i like the flowers in the front, might have cropped out the red car to give it a more secluded look.</td>', 'i like the flowers in the front, might have cropped out the red car to give it a more secluded look.', '2004-04-26 20:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
