(686417, 72142, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - good seeing.  Image apears to be a bit over-exposed.  I''d also feel better about it if the subjects were not so centered.</td>', 'Nice idea - good seeing.  Image apears to be a bit over-exposed.  I''d also feel better about it if the subjects were not so centered.', '2004-04-26 20:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
