(686419, 72272, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot at all - folows all the rules, really, and is ''properly exposed and focussed. It''s just that ... well, that''s all there is to it, really. Textures are a bit muted, but then that was inevitable when shooting for exposure as this seems t have been. Nothing much to criticise though, but also nothing uch to grab the attention.</td>', 'Not a bad shot at all - folows all the rules, really, and is ''properly exposed and focussed. It''s just that ... well, that''s all there is to it, really. Textures are a bit muted, but then that was inevitable when shooting for exposure as this seems t have been. Nothing much to criticise though, but also nothing uch to grab the attention.', '2004-04-26 20:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(686421, 71676, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice textures - nice composition.  I''m not sure the tree in the upper right adds much, but it''s not too distracting either.</td>', 'Very nice textures - nice composition.  I''m not sure the tree in the upper right adds much, but it''s not too distracting either.', '2004-04-26 20:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(686422, 72143, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  The areas where a little color show makes this a very mysterious image.  Too bad the flag wasn''t blowing a bit.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  The areas where a little color show makes this a very mysterious image.  Too bad the flag wasn''t blowing a bit.', '2004-04-26 20:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(686424, 72053, 3607, '<td valign="top">not a great day for shooting, but i think the subject is too tight in this photo giving a snapshot feel.</td>', 'not a great day for shooting, but i think the subject is too tight in this photo giving a snapshot feel.', '2004-04-26 20:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(686427, 72164, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - the leadin line from the bottom left is very effective. Exposure right on.</td>', 'Nice composition - the leadin line from the bottom left is very effective. Exposure right on.', '2004-04-26 20:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(686428, 72138, 13610, '<td valign="top">Incredible landscape!!! I''d really like to stay there. Lighting is really hard maybe trying to take this shot at the sooner or later in the day to get the light behind you would have been amazing. (7)</td>', 'Incredible landscape!!! I''d really like to stay there. Lighting is really hard maybe trying to take this shot at the sooner or later in the day to get the light behind you would have been amazing. (7)', '2004-04-26 20:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(686429, 72001, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh man I''d have made a bit more of the parallels of the barrier and the roadway ... perhaps justnshot a little lower, just to bring the barrier a little more strongly into frame. Great idea though, and good solid shooting. Given the high-key landscape shot it calls out for a graduated filter, just to calm the exposure of the clouds, but that''s your won choice: I just think it would accentuate the graphic elements of the composition a touch more. Neat idea though, and good shot.</td>', 'Oh man I''d have made a bit more of the parallels of the barrier and the roadway ... perhaps justnshot a little lower, just to bring the barrier a little more strongly into frame. Great idea though, and good solid shooting. Given the high-key landscape shot it calls out for a graduated filter, just to calm the exposure of the clouds, but that''s your won choice: I just think it would accentuate the graphic elements of the composition a touch more. Neat idea though, and good shot.', '2004-04-26 20:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(686430, 71935, 3607, '<td valign="top">great flowers and colors in the flowers.  the poor sky really detracts from the picture, i don''t know if you could have cropped it out a bit more but the front half is so great and the back half is so blah.</td>', 'great flowers and colors in the flowers.  the poor sky really detracts from the picture, i don''t know if you could have cropped it out a bit more but the front half is so great and the back half is so blah.', '2004-04-26 20:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(686431, 71854, 3607, '<td valign="top">nicely done, a bit abstract almost.</td>', 'nicely done, a bit abstract almost.', '2004-04-26 20:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(686432, 72169, 3607, '<td valign="top">neat photo.  the snow on the mountains looks great.  a bit dark overall however.</td>', 'neat photo.  the snow on the mountains looks great.  a bit dark overall however.', '2004-04-26 20:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(686436, 72002, 3607, '<td valign="top">very fun photo, although i''m not sure that all the space you left for the water in the front was necessary as the real attraction isn''t the reflection on the water of the masts, but the cunfusion in the skyline given by the masts.</td>', 'very fun photo, although i''m not sure that all the space you left for the water in the front was necessary as the real attraction isn''t the reflection on the water of the masts, but the cunfusion in the skyline given by the masts.', '2004-04-26 20:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(686438, 71871, 3607, '<td valign="top">interesting, bizzare photo.</td>', 'interesting, bizzare photo.', '2004-04-26 20:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(686440, 72270, 6999, '<td valign="top">First reaction: so what. second reaction - whoa, what''s going on here? And then, on further looking, it starts to really fascinate. The progression og blues image right, and the interruption of the pipes there, and of course the contrast of the mural and the reality (so ordinarily photographed, emphasises that humdrum nature). Parallels of the real and the painted lamp=posts and telegraph pole, and that the painted pole seems to hold the real wire, just to blur that line of connection a touch more. The light on the wet road. The parallel perspective of the real and the painted buildings. The stop sign absolutely at the intersection of the imaginary and the real ...  subtle, unassuming and wonderful photography. I fear very greatly that few voters will look deeply enough at this, however. But hell, I like it, so there.</td>', 'First reaction: so what. second reaction - whoa, what''s going on here? And then, on further looking, it starts to really fascinate. The progression og blues image right, and the interruption of the pipes there, and of course the contrast of the mural and the reality (so ordinarily photographed, emphasises that humdrum nature). Parallels of the real and the painted lamp=posts and telegraph pole, and that the painted pole seems to hold the real wire, just to blur that line of connection a touch more. The light on the wet road. The parallel perspective of the real and the painted buildings. The stop sign absolutely at the intersection of the imaginary and the real ...  subtle, unassuming and wonderful photography. I fear very greatly that few voters will look deeply enough at this, however. But hell, I like it, so there.', '2004-04-26 20:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(686441, 72335, 3607, '<td valign="top">i expect to see a sword come out of the water - very otherworldly looking.  Nice colors.</td>', 'i expect to see a sword come out of the water - very otherworldly looking.  Nice colors.', '2004-04-26 20:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(686444, 72289, 3607, '<td valign="top">not sure what the main subject of the photo is here.  colors are kind of limited - might have tried b&amp;w instead.</td>', 'not sure what the main subject of the photo is here.  colors are kind of limited - might have tried b&w instead.', '2004-04-26 20:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(686446, 72142, 3607, '<td valign="top">a bit overexposed in parts - a hard situation to photograph well.</td>', 'a bit overexposed in parts - a hard situation to photograph well.', '2004-04-26 20:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(686447, 72336, 2223, '<td valign="top">Excellent!!  Make a nice postcard.10</td>', 'Excellent!!  Make a nice postcard.10', '2004-04-26 20:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(686449, 72072, 3607, '<td valign="top">interesting how some parts are frozen and some have blur.  perhaps a bit too tight of a frame given the large area you had to work with?</td>', 'interesting how some parts are frozen and some have blur.  perhaps a bit too tight of a frame given the large area you had to work with?', '2004-04-26 20:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(686450, 72284, 3607, '<td valign="top">nicely done with the water so smoky and the lines on the rocks are great.</td>', 'nicely done with the water so smoky and the lines on the rocks are great.', '2004-04-26 20:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(686451, 72288, 6999, '<td valign="top">Bloody tame herons, huh? There''s an element of conspicuous comsumption to this shot that seems let down by it''s saturated colour and composition. It''s like a shot of a magazine-based idyllic lifestyle ... the boat, the weather, the fishing, and hell, even the wildlife will pose for your camera :-) Of course, there are other stories, but this is what I''m seeing ... the bird adds a sense, from another view, of contrast between the leisure lifestyle (no doubt expensively provided), and the on-going battles and chores of the natural world - though so far muted by the lens of ''cost'' as to be even itself prettily toned to match the landscape. In that sense, quite an embittered photograph ... but also, perhaps, a naive one.</td>', 'Bloody tame herons, huh? There''s an element of conspicuous comsumption to this shot that seems let down by it''s saturated colour and composition. It''s like a shot of a magazine-based idyllic lifestyle ... the boat, the weather, the fishing, and hell, even the wildlife will pose for your camera :-) Of course, there are other stories, but this is what I''m seeing ... the bird adds a sense, from another view, of contrast between the leisure lifestyle (no doubt expensively provided), and the on-going battles and chores of the natural world - though so far muted by the lens of ''cost'' as to be even itself prettily toned to match the landscape. In that sense, quite an embittered photograph ... but also, perhaps, a naive one.', '2004-04-26 20:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(686453, 71124, 2223, '<td valign="top">Amazing! 10</td>', 'Amazing! 10', '2004-04-26 20:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(686455, 71883, 6999, '<td valign="top">Yeah, guide-book photography for sure. I guess in that sense you meet the challenge absolutely. And yet I can''t help but be influnenced by the shots I''ve seen previous to this - those are the perils of being voted on in this manner. Somehow, that foreground golf course is an invidious element. nature tamed. the shot sets out to propose a life on the edge of the wilderness (that wonderful haze across the feet of the mountains, and the cragginess of them, and the bleakness of the show and sharp promontories there), and yet the hugely boring and suburban manicuring of a golf-course alonside it seems here to provide only a comment on man''s inability to leave well alone, these days. Perhaps that is only the modern connotations of golf, child of the television that it is, and far removed from the battle against the elements that were its foundations ... but it certainly undermines the suggestion of loneliness of this scene at first view.</td>', 'Yeah, guide-book photography for sure. I guess in that sense you meet the challenge absolutely. And yet I can''t help but be influnenced by the shots I''ve seen previous to this - those are the perils of being voted on in this manner. Somehow, that foreground golf course is an invidious element. nature tamed. the shot sets out to propose a life on the edge of the wilderness (that wonderful haze across the feet of the mountains, and the cragginess of them, and the bleakness of the show and sharp promontories there), and yet the hugely boring and suburban manicuring of a golf-course alonside it seems here to provide only a comment on man''s inability to leave well alone, these days. Perhaps that is only the modern connotations of golf, child of the television that it is, and far removed from the battle against the elements that were its foundations ... but it certainly undermines the suggestion of loneliness of this scene at first view.', '2004-04-26 20:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(686457, 71935, 6999, '<td valign="top">whoa ... bring me salt now, before the sacharrine natue of this overwhelms me! Unbelieveably tweee and manufactured suburban scene - perhsp even the perfect definition of the concept. Wonderful evocation of thhe dreaful control of that environment though, the throttling of anything that ight subvert the control, even to the point of ensuring all the flowers grow in similar-coloured groups :-) The suggestion of perfect manicuring of the lawns, and you just know there isn''t going to be a single mark on those cars :-) What a peculiar place ... and I really quite enjoy the threatening and awe-inspiring atmosphere of this shot.</td>', 'whoa ... bring me salt now, before the sacharrine natue of this overwhelms me! Unbelieveably tweee and manufactured suburban scene - perhsp even the perfect definition of the concept. Wonderful evocation of thhe dreaful control of that environment though, the throttling of anything that ight subvert the control, even to the point of ensuring all the flowers grow in similar-coloured groups :-) The suggestion of perfect manicuring of the lawns, and you just know there isn''t going to be a single mark on those cars :-) What a peculiar place ... and I really quite enjoy the threatening and awe-inspiring atmosphere of this shot.', '2004-04-26 20:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(686462, 72115, 16386, '<td valign="top">nice view!</td>', 'nice view!', '2004-04-26 20:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(686463, 71978, 16386, '<td valign="top">LOL!</td>', 'LOL!', '2004-04-26 20:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(686471, 72336, 18191, '<td valign="top">Hm...how come that dock in the background looks very familiar?...</td>', 'Hm...how come that dock in the background looks very familiar?...', '2004-04-26 20:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(686473, 71123, 16386, '<td valign="top">excellent shot...........! and so very true.</td>', 'excellent shot...........! and so very true.', '2004-04-26 20:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(686477, 72315, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lacks the depth of detail for a really fine shot, and perhaps also the contrast is overly heavy - shadow detail is missing, and highlights somewhat blown out. There''s a feeling too of being overly warm coloured - like you haven''t coped with the white balance required, like there may be more variety of colour in the light than you''ve captured, which might have added some depth of interest to the shot.</td>', 'Lacks the depth of detail for a really fine shot, and perhaps also the contrast is overly heavy - shadow detail is missing, and highlights somewhat blown out. There''s a feeling too of being overly warm coloured - like you haven''t coped with the white balance required, like there may be more variety of colour in the light than you''ve captured, which might have added some depth of interest to the shot.', '2004-04-26 21:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(686479, 72338, 16386, '<td valign="top">very cute - i like it.</td>', 'very cute - i like it.', '2004-04-26 21:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
