(686506, 72288, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice colors - diagonal composition of the shoreline works well.  Seems like too many things are competing for attention.</td>', 'Nice colors - diagonal composition of the shoreline works well.  Seems like too many things are competing for attention.', '2004-04-26 21:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
