(686589, 72336, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, diagonal composition.  Repeating shares of the building and shadows very effective.  Perfect time of day to take this one.</td>', 'Great lighting, diagonal composition.  Repeating shares of the building and shadows very effective.  Perfect time of day to take this one.', '2004-04-26 22:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
