(686651, 72087, 4767, '<td valign="top">Mmmmmmm!  Makes me think of Anthony''s Home Port!  NOW I want to go visit my family in Seattle.  (Nice shot!  Evokes good memories and feelings!)</td>', 'Mmmmmmm!  Makes me think of Anthony''s Home Port!  NOW I want to go visit my family in Seattle.  (Nice shot!  Evokes good memories and feelings!)', '2004-04-26 22:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
