(686665, 72072, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ah - what a place!  Nice exposure and a great feel of the spot.  The moving traffic is a real plus.</td>', 'Ah - what a place!  Nice exposure and a great feel of the spot.  The moving traffic is a real plus.', '2004-04-26 23:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
