(686671, 72322, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful.  The subtle colors are excellent.  The birds add a nice touch - but it would be better if they were closer.  My biggest concern is the bald white sky.  If the sky were more dramatic - you get at least another point from me, probably more.</td>', 'Very peaceful.  The subtle colors are excellent.  The birds add a nice touch - but it would be better if they were closer.  My biggest concern is the bald white sky.  If the sky were more dramatic - you get at least another point from me, probably more.', '2004-04-26 23:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
