(686685, 71581, 327, '<td valign="top">I think this shot has several things going for it..<br/>IMHO..<br/>the colors and the emotional factor. MLK It really comes together for a pretty shot. Well done.</td>', 'I think this shot has several things going for it..IMHO..the colors and the emotional factor. MLK It really comes together for a pretty shot. Well done.', '2004-04-26 23:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
