(686860, 72093, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and well-composed. I like the use of reflections.  A few things that can be improved: 1. Perspective correction to straighten the buildings. 2. Rotate your image CW to level the horizon. 3. Seems a little over-sharpened... there are halos around the buildings.</td>', 'Nice colours and well-composed. I like the use of reflections.  A few things that can be improved: 1. Perspective correction to straighten the buildings. 2. Rotate your image CW to level the horizon. 3. Seems a little over-sharpened... there are halos around the buildings.', '2004-04-27 02:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
