(686954, 72336, 4008, '<td valign="top">I really like the soft colors and the bit of haze in this image and the repeating patterns of the houses and the shadows on the road. I am just wondering whether cropping a small bit of the left side would improve it further, or whether that is needed to stop the eye wanting to move further out of the picture. Good one anyway.</td>', 'I really like the soft colors and the bit of haze in this image and the repeating patterns of the houses and the shadows on the road. I am just wondering whether cropping a small bit of the left side would improve it further, or whether that is needed to stop the eye wanting to move further out of the picture. Good one anyway.', '2004-04-27 04:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
