(687003, 72099, 4767, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Not Chicago, or L.a., nor Seattle nor Miami.  Could those be Cache Valley mountains?</td>', 'Hmmm.  Not Chicago, or L.a., nor Seattle nor Miami.  Could those be Cache Valley mountains?', '2004-04-27 05:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(687008, 72085, 4767, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot!  Well seen, well executed - maybe a hair over-sharpened.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot!  Well seen, well executed - maybe a hair over-sharpened.', '2004-04-27 05:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(687012, 72165, 16004, '<td valign="top">You missed the longitude and latitude from your title ;)  This is a very attractive picture - the only things i might''ve considered changing is the crop (lose some of the sky and the right third portion, thereby focusing a little more on the purple/pink blossom) and I might have been tempted to cloned out the human.  Other than that, a very nice picture, and it would appear you are very lucky to live in such a pleasant environment.  7.</td>', 'You missed the longitude and latitude from your title ;)  This is a very attractive picture - the only things i might''ve considered changing is the crop (lose some of the sky and the right third portion, thereby focusing a little more on the purple/pink blossom) and I might have been tempted to cloned out the human.  Other than that, a very nice picture, and it would appear you are very lucky to live in such a pleasant environment.  7.', '2004-04-27 05:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(687024, 72274, 16004, '<td valign="top">I would imagine you icelanders find it difficult to walk to the shops for a pint of milk without stumbling over something incredibly photogenic.  I have always wanted to see and explore your strange and wonderful land, and DPChallenge just makes the longing worse.  Anyway - I like this very much.  I do think that a very slight reduction in brightness might have been worthwhile, and it might appear picky, but i might have cropped the last 10mm off the right.  But aside from that, very little appears wrong with it, and i hope it does well!</td>', 'I would imagine you icelanders find it difficult to walk to the shops for a pint of milk without stumbling over something incredibly photogenic.  I have always wanted to see and explore your strange and wonderful land, and DPChallenge just makes the longing worse.  Anyway - I like this very much.  I do think that a very slight reduction in brightness might have been worthwhile, and it might appear picky, but i might have cropped the last 10mm off the right.  But aside from that, very little appears wrong with it, and i hope it does well!', '2004-04-27 06:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(687029, 71728, 18160, '<td valign="top">Great early morning/evening shot.  The depth-of-field is nice without the lensflaire of a long exposure.</td>', 'Great early morning/evening shot.  The depth-of-field is nice without the lensflaire of a long exposure.', '2004-04-27 06:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
