(687061, 71124, 10883, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture!  I´m a sucker for good night shoots.<br/>The reflections come out very well!<br/>Good job!</td>', 'Excellent capture!  I´m a sucker for good night shoots.The reflections come out very well!Good job!', '2004-04-27 07:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(687068, 72093, 16004, '<td valign="top">From (painfull) experience, it appears that photos with a large percentage of sky for some reason often doesn''t do well.  Well, those voters are wrong darn it to heck - a good dramatic sky always works for me, and this is a case in point.  The sky here is gorgeous. Unfortunately, it appears that something has gone a bit awry with some of the buildings away from the centre, which in turn gives the impression of a wonky shot.  In  certain post processing software this effect could be minimised a little by distorting the image (using free transform in PS).  Still, it''s certainly an attractive skyline.</td>', 'From (painfull) experience, it appears that photos with a large percentage of sky for some reason often doesn''t do well.  Well, those voters are wrong darn it to heck - a good dramatic sky always works for me, and this is a case in point.  The sky here is gorgeous. Unfortunately, it appears that something has gone a bit awry with some of the buildings away from the centre, which in turn gives the impression of a wonky shot.  In  certain post processing software this effect could be minimised a little by distorting the image (using free transform in PS).  Still, it''s certainly an attractive skyline.', '2004-04-27 07:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(687069, 71935, 5728, '<td valign="top">Well I guess there is only one person I know from Schaumburg :)))) Good shot man, very saturated, the colors come over well.</td>', 'Well I guess there is only one person I know from Schaumburg :)))) Good shot man, very saturated, the colors come over well.', '2004-04-27 07:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(687073, 72267, 4008, '<td valign="top">Not a very attractive scene, nothing to see which would pull tourists to your place. And taken from a very standard angle and height. If this was the scene you were stuck with you might try a extremely low angle, just a few cm above the ground, that would already make it more interesting. If possible also different time of day with more warm light. But first I would look for another scene, with at least some interesting elements, every town has some.</td>', 'Not a very attractive scene, nothing to see which would pull tourists to your place. And taken from a very standard angle and height. If this was the scene you were stuck with you might try a extremely low angle, just a few cm above the ground, that would already make it more interesting. If possible also different time of day with more warm light. But first I would look for another scene, with at least some interesting elements, every town has some.', '2004-04-27 07:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(687075, 72122, 4008, '<td valign="top">Creative and confusing. Make me want to look again and find out what is happening. Raises interest. I like it and rank it accordingly, although not at the top.</td>', 'Creative and confusing. Make me want to look again and find out what is happening. Raises interest. I like it and rank it accordingly, although not at the top.', '2004-04-27 07:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(687089, 71482, 1024, '<td valign="top">This photo makes me want to visit Switzerland even more.  Beautiful!</td>', 'This photo makes me want to visit Switzerland even more.  Beautiful!', '2004-04-27 08:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(687091, 71993, 1024, '<td valign="top">I wish I knew where this was taken, then I would know where my next vacation would be. I especially like the DOF, with the flowers in the foreground being out of focus.  nicely done!</td>', 'I wish I knew where this was taken, then I would know where my next vacation would be. I especially like the DOF, with the flowers in the foreground being out of focus.  nicely done!', '2004-04-27 08:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(687092, 71940, 1024, '<td valign="top">Just as I imagined a Spanish village to be.  Wonderful!</td>', 'Just as I imagined a Spanish village to be.  Wonderful!', '2004-04-27 08:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(687094, 72119, 1024, '<td valign="top">The storm clouds really make this photo.  Good timing!</td>', 'The storm clouds really make this photo.  Good timing!', '2004-04-27 08:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(687102, 72121, 14614, '<td valign="top">nice coposition (sky to tree to land ratio), excellent sky, house gets a bit lost in the trees and loses detail that I think would help the shot as it could become the main subject.</td>', 'nice coposition (sky to tree to land ratio), excellent sky, house gets a bit lost in the trees and loses detail that I think would help the shot as it could become the main subject.', '2004-04-27 08:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(687104, 72253, 14614, '<td valign="top">seems a bit tilted - Mt Hood pulls my eye through to the background, great colors, foreground detracts a bit from the scene</td>', 'seems a bit tilted - Mt Hood pulls my eye through to the background, great colors, foreground detracts a bit from the scene', '2004-04-27 08:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(687106, 71978, 14614, '<td valign="top">this shot freaks me out... you''ve done a good job in creating an emotional reaction on my part.  (I hope you got them out of the road right after taking the shot!)</td>', 'this shot freaks me out... you''ve done a good job in creating an emotional reaction on my part.  (I hope you got them out of the road right after taking the shot!)', '2004-04-27 08:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(687108, 72133, 14614, '<td valign="top">What a great collection of mailboxes -- good eye for finding it and capturing it quite well.</td>', 'What a great collection of mailboxes -- good eye for finding it and capturing it quite well.', '2004-04-27 08:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(687109, 72294, 18505, '<td valign="top">Truly creative!  This is one of my favorites for this challenge.</td>', 'Truly creative!  This is one of my favorites for this challenge.', '2004-04-27 08:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(687117, 72280, 4008, '<td valign="top">A slightly different angle might have removed the background which now draws quite a lot of attention but there is nothing really to see.  Maybe taken from the other side, would that have included something interesting of your town ? Just an idea. I like the color and clarity.</td>', 'A slightly different angle might have removed the background which now draws quite a lot of attention but there is nothing really to see.  Maybe taken from the other side, would that have included something interesting of your town ? Just an idea. I like the color and clarity.', '2004-04-27 09:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(687119, 71854, 4008, '<td valign="top">It is neither a strong silhouette nor a nicely lit subject. The lighthouse is lost in the darkness against the dark background, which is a pity since this scene seems to offer lots of potential. It probably would have been better to get closer, isolate the subject more so it is better recognisable and you get a stronger composition.</td>', 'It is neither a strong silhouette nor a nicely lit subject. The lighthouse is lost in the darkness against the dark background, which is a pity since this scene seems to offer lots of potential. It probably would have been better to get closer, isolate the subject more so it is better recognisable and you get a stronger composition.', '2004-04-27 09:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(687124, 72115, 4008, '<td valign="top">it''s different allright, but the angle and distortion makes me drunk. A nice clear and clean scene, with good composition/crop, but a bit too extreme approach for me. 6</td>', 'it''s different allright, but the angle and distortion makes me drunk. A nice clear and clean scene, with good composition/crop, but a bit too extreme approach for me. 6', '2004-04-27 09:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(687133, 72119, 4008, '<td valign="top">Let me guess : Rejkjavik ?  It has this typical Icelandic atmosphere with this strong blue and dramatic sky, which has become almost a trademark here at DPC. I like it. I would crop away the building cranes on the left side of the image.</td>', 'Let me guess : Rejkjavik ?  It has this typical Icelandic atmosphere with this strong blue and dramatic sky, which has become almost a trademark here at DPC. I like it. I would crop away the building cranes on the left side of the image.', '2004-04-27 09:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(687134, 71728, 4008, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit too dark, but I like the combination of the modern architecture and the absolute stillness of the water giving a perfect reflection.</td>', 'Maybe a bit too dark, but I like the combination of the modern architecture and the absolute stillness of the water giving a perfect reflection.', '2004-04-27 09:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(687135, 72247, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great view and perfect composition to really create this feeling of depth. Could maybe made to pop a bit more by some more contrast.</td>', 'Great view and perfect composition to really create this feeling of depth. Could maybe made to pop a bit more by some more contrast.', '2004-04-27 09:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(687151, 72136, 6532, '<td valign="top">At first this picture says "wow" but then I look at those parts that should be white and I see a bit too much blue....and the sky is really saturated.... is it possible that this photo is a bit over-saturated, grainy, or both?</td>', 'At first this picture says "wow" but then I look at those parts that should be white and I see a bit too much blue....and the sky is really saturated.... is it possible that this photo is a bit over-saturated, grainy, or both?', '2004-04-27 10:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(687157, 71365, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice vibrant colors in a good composition.  Too bad the sky doesn''t help you much.</td>', 'Nice vibrant colors in a good composition.  Too bad the sky doesn''t help you much.', '2004-04-27 10:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(687164, 71124, 5391, '<td valign="top">Truly beautiful, professional-quality shot.  Perfect exposure, colors, and I like the "smeary" reflection in the water where all the colors really come alive.  Nice sky, too.  9</td>', 'Truly beautiful, professional-quality shot.  Perfect exposure, colors, and I like the "smeary" reflection in the water where all the colors really come alive.  Nice sky, too.  9', '2004-04-27 10:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(687165, 72066, 5391, '<td valign="top">VERY creative shot - one of the most creative of the challenge!  Beautiful.  9</td>', 'VERY creative shot - one of the most creative of the challenge!  Beautiful.  9', '2004-04-27 10:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(687167, 72274, 5391, '<td valign="top">I think some people will not care much for the abstractness of this, but you''ve done it so incredibly well and I love it.  The detail is wonderful, composition is perfectly balanced, and the green and gray combination works very well.  9</td>', 'I think some people will not care much for the abstractness of this, but you''ve done it so incredibly well and I love it.  The detail is wonderful, composition is perfectly balanced, and the green and gray combination works very well.  9', '2004-04-27 10:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(687171, 72169, 20047, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo</td>', 'beautiful photo', '2004-04-27 10:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(687172, 71123, 5391, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the challenge.  Very artistic.  I can see this on the wall of a gallery or art museum.  It would also work very well as a stock photograph.  I love that big, huge looming sky and the tiny figures at the bottom.  Great that you''ve got them so isolated.  10</td>', 'One of my favorites of the challenge.  Very artistic.  I can see this on the wall of a gallery or art museum.  It would also work very well as a stock photograph.  I love that big, huge looming sky and the tiny figures at the bottom.  Great that you''ve got them so isolated.  10', '2004-04-27 10:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(687173, 72126, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very picturesque shot.  I love the muted colors, the very dynamic composition and the placement of the building.  The colors invoke a very romantic feel, and there''s just enough detail in the sky to really keep the entire frame interesting.  8</td>', 'Very picturesque shot.  I love the muted colors, the very dynamic composition and the placement of the building.  The colors invoke a very romantic feel, and there''s just enough detail in the sky to really keep the entire frame interesting.  8', '2004-04-27 10:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(687176, 72333, 6532, '<td valign="top">The shadow is a bit too dark.  More space on the left of the building would have helped. <br/></td>', 'The shadow is a bit too dark.  More space on the left of the building would have helped. ', '2004-04-27 10:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(687177, 72121, 6532, '<td valign="top">Does this picture slope to the left?</td>', 'Does this picture slope to the left?', '2004-04-27 10:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(687179, 72272, 6532, '<td valign="top">Does this picture slope to the right?  Otherwise, I like the colors. 7</td>', 'Does this picture slope to the right?  Otherwise, I like the colors. 7', '2004-04-27 10:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(687180, 71672, 6532, '<td valign="top">Definitely creative...</td>', 'Definitely creative...', '2004-04-27 10:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(687184, 72234, 6532, '<td valign="top">This would have been nicer if the full reflection of the tree could be seen.....</td>', 'This would have been nicer if the full reflection of the tree could be seen.....', '2004-04-27 10:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(687186, 72223, 6532, '<td valign="top">Does everything slope to the left?  Great colors.</td>', 'Does everything slope to the left?  Great colors.', '2004-04-27 10:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(687188, 72315, 6532, '<td valign="top">a bit out of focus....</td>', 'a bit out of focus....', '2004-04-27 10:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(687190, 71247, 6532, '<td valign="top">Is this really where you live?  How lucky can you be....</td>', 'Is this really where you live?  How lucky can you be....', '2004-04-27 11:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(687230, 72002, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the way the cityscape gets lost in the sailboat mast-scape.  Interesting!</td>', 'I like the way the cityscape gets lost in the sailboat mast-scape.  Interesting!', '2004-04-27 11:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(687238, 72333, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think it would be nice to have the building less cropped.  I like the absence of color though - conveys a great mood.</td>', 'I think it would be nice to have the building less cropped.  I like the absence of color though - conveys a great mood.', '2004-04-27 11:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(687240, 72071, 20204, '<td valign="top">Almost too busy for my liking...  But I would be hard pressed to do this well on the exposure!  It''s easy to critique when you''re not the one tripping the shutter.</td>', 'Almost too busy for my liking...  But I would be hard pressed to do this well on the exposure!  It''s easy to critique when you''re not the one tripping the shutter.', '2004-04-27 11:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(687241, 72164, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the way this is composed!</td>', 'I love the way this is composed!', '2004-04-27 11:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(687244, 72001, 20204, '<td valign="top">The sky looks a bit too purple to me, but I did enjoy the symmetry with the guardrail and the road''s bend.</td>', 'The sky looks a bit too purple to me, but I did enjoy the symmetry with the guardrail and the road''s bend.', '2004-04-27 11:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(687248, 72136, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very rish blue in this shot...  The streetlights are also a nice touch without being distracting.</td>', 'Very rish blue in this shot...  The streetlights are also a nice touch without being distracting.', '2004-04-27 11:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(687251, 71957, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast in this shot!</td>', 'I love the contrast in this shot!', '2004-04-27 11:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(687253, 71482, 18194, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful looking town. Sring looks very nice there.</td>', 'What a wonderful looking town. Sring looks very nice there.', '2004-04-27 11:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(687255, 72242, 20204, '<td valign="top">Beutiful area, but I would have loved to see more contrast / detail.  Looks like that would be difficult with the light being so bright.</td>', 'Beutiful area, but I would have loved to see more contrast / detail.  Looks like that would be difficult with the light being so bright.', '2004-04-27 11:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(687259, 72087, 327, '<td valign="top">Very pretty with nice colors. Post card invitation.</td>', 'Very pretty with nice colors. Post card invitation.', '2004-04-27 11:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(687262, 71717, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, dof and light. Looks like a great area, inviting. Hope you do well, good luck.</td>', 'Lovely colors, dof and light. Looks like a great area, inviting. Hope you do well, good luck.', '2004-04-27 11:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(687268, 72119, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the detail through the image, and the dramatic sky.  This image makes me feel like I''m there.  Very much enjoyed it!</td>', 'I love the detail through the image, and the dramatic sky.  This image makes me feel like I''m there.  Very much enjoyed it!', '2004-04-27 11:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(687269, 71672, 9941, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic!</td>', 'Very dramatic!', '2004-04-27 11:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(687271, 72248, 327, '<td valign="top">The bridge cuts the shot off on the right while the fence cuts it in half. I think a better composition would of made this score higher. Neat spot to shoot.</td>', 'The bridge cuts the shot off on the right while the fence cuts it in half. I think a better composition would of made this score higher. Neat spot to shoot.', '2004-04-27 11:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(687282, 72264, 19753, '<td valign="top">Good Job I think it is the best onr</td>', 'Good Job I think it is the best onr', '2004-04-27 12:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(687283, 71683, 15642, '<td valign="top">Cute, but the spot color is a bit dated.</td>', 'Cute, but the spot color is a bit dated.', '2004-04-27 12:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(687284, 71634, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but this doesn''t tell me anything about where you live. In fact, I can''t tell what city this is in.</td>', 'Nice composition, but this doesn''t tell me anything about where you live. In fact, I can''t tell what city this is in.', '2004-04-27 12:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(687285, 72131, 15642, '<td valign="top">Vancouver?</td>', 'Vancouver?', '2004-04-27 12:08:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(687286, 71201, 15642, '<td valign="top">I like the shot. Your shadow on the sign is a bit distracting, though. The title is confusing, as well. Nice all in all, tho...</td>', 'I like the shot. Your shadow on the sign is a bit distracting, though. The title is confusing, as well. Nice all in all, tho...', '2004-04-27 12:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(687287, 72297, 18194, '<td valign="top">To me this looks like a last minute snap just to have something to submit.  The bright light wants to be the focus of the photo but there is nothing really interesting there.</td>', 'To me this looks like a last minute snap just to have something to submit.  The bright light wants to be the focus of the photo but there is nothing really interesting there.', '2004-04-27 12:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(687288, 71247, 15642, '<td valign="top">Pretty. The clouds are perfect. I may lose the border, but great shot.</td>', 'Pretty. The clouds are perfect. I may lose the border, but great shot.', '2004-04-27 12:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(687289, 71957, 15642, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Nice composition. 8.</td>', 'Very well done. Nice composition. 8.', '2004-04-27 12:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(687290, 72330, 15642, '<td valign="top">OK, but it seems like there are better shots to be had in Chicago than the freeway.</td>', 'OK, but it seems like there are better shots to be had in Chicago than the freeway.', '2004-04-27 12:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(687291, 72280, 15642, '<td valign="top">Not getting anything specific to where you live here. Pretty flowers, though.</td>', 'Not getting anything specific to where you live here. Pretty flowers, though.', '2004-04-27 12:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(687292, 72042, 18194, '<td valign="top">If you had not messed this up in PS it would have been a good photo. I am sorry but I dont see any photographic integrity here at all.</td>', 'If you had not messed this up in PS it would have been a good photo. I am sorry but I dont see any photographic integrity here at all.', '2004-04-27 12:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(687294, 72095, 15642, '<td valign="top">Points off for having a guitar in the shot. Kidding! Nice shot of TO...</td>', 'Points off for having a guitar in the shot. Kidding! Nice shot of TO...', '2004-04-27 12:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(687296, 72250, 18194, '<td valign="top">This photo seems to be lacking detail. It is very hard to know what we are looking at.</td>', 'This photo seems to be lacking detail. It is very hard to know what we are looking at.', '2004-04-27 12:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(687299, 72331, 4008, '<td valign="top">Good clear, bright and attractive image. Nice close view to become part of the action.</td>', 'Good clear, bright and attractive image. Nice close view to become part of the action.', '2004-04-27 12:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(687302, 72139, 15642, '<td valign="top">I don''t get a great sense of ''where you live'' from here. The spot color is a tad dated, too. Cute kid, though!</td>', 'I don''t get a great sense of ''where you live'' from here. The spot color is a tad dated, too. Cute kid, though!', '2004-04-27 12:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(687303, 72338, 4008, '<td valign="top">I am normally not fond of partial desaturation, but on this one it works well, it creates a focal point in the row of mailboxes.</td>', 'I am normally not fond of partial desaturation, but on this one it works well, it creates a focal point in the row of mailboxes.', '2004-04-27 12:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(687304, 72099, 18194, '<td valign="top">I think this does give a very nice feel for you town.  The mountain in the background is wonderful but I find the tree over powers it just a bit.</td>', 'I think this does give a very nice feel for you town.  The mountain in the background is wonderful but I find the tree over powers it just a bit.', '2004-04-27 12:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(687308, 72115, 18194, '<td valign="top">For me the tilted and distorted view does not do much, others might like it however.</td>', 'For me the tilted and distorted view does not do much, others might like it however.', '2004-04-27 12:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(687312, 71365, 18194, '<td valign="top">I assume you are south of the equator, beautiful colors.</td>', 'I assume you are south of the equator, beautiful colors.', '2004-04-27 12:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(687320, 71940, 18709, '<td valign="top">This part of Tossa is probably unchanged since I visited it in 1954.  This is a very nice casual uphill shot.</td>', 'This part of Tossa is probably unchanged since I visited it in 1954.  This is a very nice casual uphill shot.', '2004-04-27 12:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(687321, 72169, 18194, '<td valign="top">A very good photograph in my opinion.  The foreground is just a bit dark for me but not by much7</td>', 'A very good photograph in my opinion.  The foreground is just a bit dark for me but not by much7', '2004-04-27 12:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(687324, 71676, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting building, perhaps a little bit too determinedly twee, with the irregular stonework and and the turret roof; but effective.</td>', 'This is an interesting building, perhaps a little bit too determinedly twee, with the irregular stonework and and the turret roof; but effective.', '2004-04-27 12:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(687325, 72253, 18194, '<td valign="top">I use to live here, almost unfair to have such a beautiful city for this challenge. Very nice job at getting Mt. Hood to stand out so well..8</td>', 'I use to live here, almost unfair to have such a beautiful city for this challenge. Very nice job at getting Mt. Hood to stand out so well..8', '2004-04-27 12:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(687327, 72085, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, with the spray misting up the surface and the ranges of hills fading to paler and paler colours as they recede.    It looks a nice place to live.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, with the spray misting up the surface and the ranges of hills fading to paler and paler colours as they recede.    It looks a nice place to live.', '2004-04-27 12:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
