(687732, 72119, 16301, '<td valign="top">The boat in the foreground and the city in the background provide a great composition and leads the eye in that direction. The sky''s dark color shows that its about to unleash its fury upon the city, a great atmosphere and moody colors.<br/> <br/>Hope to see you in the top ten :)<br/> <br/>Great work, keep it up...</td>', 'The boat in the foreground and the city in the background provide a great composition and leads the eye in that direction. The sky''s dark color shows that its about to unleash its fury upon the city, a great atmosphere and moody colors. Hope to see you in the top ten :) Great work, keep it up...', '2004-04-27 17:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(687735, 72333, 3569, '<td valign="top">IMO cropped a bit too tight.</td>', 'IMO cropped a bit too tight.', '2004-04-27 17:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(687737, 72169, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful scene/composition and tone. It shows a great deal of depth. I like how that path leads the eye to the city and then to the mountains. A really great photo.<br/> <br/>Hope to see you in the top ten :)<br/> <br/>Great work, keep it up...</td>', 'Very beautiful scene/composition and tone. It shows a great deal of depth. I like how that path leads the eye to the city and then to the mountains. A really great photo. Hope to see you in the top ten :) Great work, keep it up...', '2004-04-27 17:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(687740, 72336, 16301, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene and depth. The composition is really great. Nice range of colors. I like how you captured the shadows. Great photo.<br/> <br/>Hope to see you in the top ten :)<br/> <br/>Great work, keep it up...</td>', 'Beautiful scene and depth. The composition is really great. Nice range of colors. I like how you captured the shadows. Great photo. Hope to see you in the top ten :) Great work, keep it up...', '2004-04-27 17:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
