(687778, 71935, 19608, '<td valign="top">The bottom half of this image is absolutely superb.  Great colors, composition.  Then there''s that bald white sky.  Suggestion:  Try a graduated neutral density filter. Another VERY MINOR point is to eliminate that tiny bit of red right at the base.  Overall - excellent seeing and shooting -kepp up the good work.</td>', 'The bottom half of this image is absolutely superb.  Great colors, composition.  Then there''s that bald white sky.  Suggestion:  Try a graduated neutral density filter. Another VERY MINOR point is to eliminate that tiny bit of red right at the base.  Overall - excellent seeing and shooting -kepp up the good work.', '2004-04-27 18:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(687782, 72247, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great perspective - exposure.  The only minor comment I''d make is that since that sky is so bright at the very top, attracting attention, I''d just take it out all together.  Your image is superb without it.  It''s so minot that I''m not taking away any points however.  Very nice job.</td>', 'Great perspective - exposure.  The only minor comment I''d make is that since that sky is so bright at the very top, attracting attention, I''d just take it out all together.  Your image is superb without it.  It''s so minot that I''m not taking away any points however.  Very nice job.', '2004-04-27 18:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(687783, 72284, 19608, '<td valign="top">WONDERFUL black and white rendition.  Great crisp whites and dark dark blacks.  Ansel would be proud of you.  Just the perfect shutter speed to capture the velvety water.  One of my favorites so far but I''m sure you will probably have some voters question that it shows "where you live."  Obviously a well-planned image.  Perhaps the water is a bit over, but it doesn''t bother me.</td>', 'WONDERFUL black and white rendition.  Great crisp whites and dark dark blacks.  Ansel would be proud of you.  Just the perfect shutter speed to capture the velvety water.  One of my favorites so far but I''m sure you will probably have some voters question that it shows "where you live."  Obviously a well-planned image.  Perhaps the water is a bit over, but it doesn''t bother me.', '2004-04-27 18:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
