(687792, 72068, 19608, '<td valign="top">What a perfect time of day to take this one!  The lighting is exquisite.  It''s getting a very high score - but here''s something to think about next time:  If a player were moving - causing a blurred motion, it would really rock!</td>', 'What a perfect time of day to take this one!  The lighting is exquisite.  It''s getting a very high score - but here''s something to think about next time:  If a player were moving - causing a blurred motion, it would really rock!', '2004-04-27 18:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
