(688194, 72284, 7778, '<td valign="top">A dramatic b &amp; white with well-contained contrasts and defined detail. The slow shutter speed, here, actually serves the purpose to proliferate the rock formation and its undulating texture as the photo''s primary subject. While not a quiet picture (the highlights are strong, at least in part/the viewer is drawn into it via a spraying cataract), the composition is balanced by the available light and anchored by darkness. What I find particularly satisfying is the strong impression of depth realized and captured here.<br/> <br/>The title, however, strikes me as somewhat too broad in scope and ambiguous for an image like this.<br/>Nevertheless, there are none better than this (IMHO) in this challenge.</td>', 'A dramatic b & white with well-contained contrasts and defined detail. The slow shutter speed, here, actually serves the purpose to proliferate the rock formation and its undulating texture as the photo''s primary subject. While not a quiet picture (the highlights are strong, at least in part/the viewer is drawn into it via a spraying cataract), the composition is balanced by the available light and anchored by darkness. What I find particularly satisfying is the strong impression of depth realized and captured here. The title, however, strikes me as somewhat too broad in scope and ambiguous for an image like this.Nevertheless, there are none better than this (IMHO) in this challenge.', '2004-04-28 01:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(688271, 72136, 13158, '<td valign="top">Can''t vote because I"m not a full member but I would definitely give this a 10.  It''s one of my favorites for the challenge.  I love the sky and the way it reflects on the building.  Nice job, good luck during voting!</td>', 'Can''t vote because I"m not a full member but I would definitely give this a 10.  It''s one of my favorites for the challenge.  I love the sky and the way it reflects on the building.  Nice job, good luck during voting!', '2004-04-28 01:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(688280, 71957, 13158, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image!  Love the contrast on the building.  The right side by the trees is a bit hot but otherwise this image is terrific!  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image!  Love the contrast on the building.  The right side by the trees is a bit hot but otherwise this image is terrific!  Good luck on the challenge.', '2004-04-28 01:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(688294, 72095, 12962, '<td valign="top">Fantastic view of Auckland ... err ... Toronto (added in edit). The two fishing figures add scale, story and add a sense of being there.  Beautiful! Ten from me.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-03 12:29:39.</i></td>', 'Fantastic view of Auckland ... err ... Toronto (added in edit). The two fishing figures add scale, story and add a sense of being there.  Beautiful! Ten from me.', '2004-04-28 01:43:58.000000', '2004-05-03 13:29:39.000000', 1),
