(688857, 71588, 13381, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the juxtaposition of primary colors and the reflection of the boats and piers in the water.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the juxtaposition of primary colors and the reflection of the boats and piers in the water.', '2004-04-28 10:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
