(689597, 71634, 13035, '<td valign="top">One of the few photgrahs in the challenge that helped me to feel what it feels like where you live, not just what it looks like.  thanks for doing something refreshing.  This DPC crowd is sooooooooo homogenized!!!</td>', 'One of the few photgrahs in the challenge that helped me to feel what it feels like where you live, not just what it looks like.  thanks for doing something refreshing.  This DPC crowd is sooooooooo homogenized!!!', '2004-04-28 18:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
