(690697, 72164, 6667, '<td valign="top">Every time I look at this shot my estimation of it increases.  My only comment is I wish it were shot at ground level.  From this perspective the structures looks miniature. . . homes for the Hobbits.  I am not sure that is your intention. At first the pale coloring bothered me. But it gives a painted quality.  Ok. One moere comment. Just a little sharper focus would have added immensely to this beautiful setting.  BOL  7 from me</td>', 'Every time I look at this shot my estimation of it increases.  My only comment is I wish it were shot at ground level.  From this perspective the structures looks miniature. . . homes for the Hobbits.  I am not sure that is your intention. At first the pale coloring bothered me. But it gives a painted quality.  Ok. One moere comment. Just a little sharper focus would have added immensely to this beautiful setting.  BOL  7 from me', '2004-04-29 13:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(690706, 72293, 14032, '<td valign="top">Who?</td>', 'Who?', '2004-04-29 13:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(690707, 72169, 14032, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge!  Great work!</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge!  Great work!', '2004-04-29 13:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
