(690720, 72122, 6667, '<td valign="top">Would make an excellent entry for the abstract challenge also.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Would make an excellent entry for the abstract challenge also.  Nicely done.', '2004-04-29 14:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(690726, 71581, 6667, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  In my own personal opinion:  I wonder if less is not more, ie, if it had been cropped to leave out the window and sill.  BOL</td>', 'Very nice.  In my own personal opinion:  I wonder if less is not more, ie, if it had been cropped to leave out the window and sill.  BOL', '2004-04-29 14:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(690740, 72178, 3724, '<td valign="top">wonderful little tilt to the tower.....     usa - patriotic colour to me seems like a curious scheme for such a utilitarian object, but not uncommon.  Your rendering of the colour is good.  I enjoy the choice of subject matter.</td>', 'wonderful little tilt to the tower.....     usa - patriotic colour to me seems like a curious scheme for such a utilitarian object, but not uncommon.  Your rendering of the colour is good.  I enjoy the choice of subject matter.', '2004-04-29 14:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(690749, 72223, 16982, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, but some of the verticals appear to be slightly slanted.</td>', 'Very nice picture, but some of the verticals appear to be slightly slanted.', '2004-04-29 14:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(690780, 72229, 3724, '<td valign="top">Good take on this famous Art Deco - Art Nouveau emblem at night.</td>', 'Good take on this famous Art Deco - Art Nouveau emblem at night.', '2004-04-29 15:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(690787, 72042, 16004, '<td valign="top">FAR too much fun with photoshop!  It''s certainly a dramatic shot, no question there.  Purely on a personal taste, the way that the image has been so editted seems a bit excessive, but then i''d imagine there are others who will no doubt totally dig what you''ve done. I do acknowledge that it''s been altered skilfully - the red in the water is an especially good touch.  I wouldn''t have polarised the buildings - I think that''s thing that i can''t quite digest.  Sky is gorgeous though - I would have been tempted to crop it with two thirds sky, rather than two-thirds water.  it just seems a little unbalanced.  good brave effort though. 6.</td>', 'FAR too much fun with photoshop!  It''s certainly a dramatic shot, no question there.  Purely on a personal taste, the way that the image has been so editted seems a bit excessive, but then i''d imagine there are others who will no doubt totally dig what you''ve done. I do acknowledge that it''s been altered skilfully - the red in the water is an especially good touch.  I wouldn''t have polarised the buildings - I think that''s thing that i can''t quite digest.  Sky is gorgeous though - I would have been tempted to crop it with two thirds sky, rather than two-thirds water.  it just seems a little unbalanced.  good brave effort though. 6.', '2004-04-29 15:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(690804, 72011, 12802, '<td valign="top">Think your DOF lets you down here, the front of your shot isn''t in focus.</td>', 'Think your DOF lets you down here, the front of your shot isn''t in focus.', '2004-04-29 15:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(690808, 72138, 12802, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I like the trees at the fornt of your shot, then again, if it was cropped to take them out, again it wouldn''t look right...  I do like the mountains in the background, it''s great that I can see each ridge etc on them.</td>', 'Not sure if I like the trees at the fornt of your shot, then again, if it was cropped to take them out, again it wouldn''t look right...  I do like the mountains in the background, it''s great that I can see each ridge etc on them.', '2004-04-29 16:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(690809, 72247, 12802, '<td valign="top">Now that looks high up... &lt;dizzy&gt;<br/> <br/>I good shot, great details all the way down to the colourful cars!</td>', 'Now that looks high up... <dizzy> I good shot, great details all the way down to the colourful cars!', '2004-04-29 16:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(690829, 72070, 13602, '<td valign="top">I wish for a bit more contrast and/or sharpness in this, other than that it is the best composition in the challenge I seen so far.</td>', 'I wish for a bit more contrast and/or sharpness in this, other than that it is the best composition in the challenge I seen so far.', '2004-04-29 16:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(690836, 71482, 13602, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition verry interesting place well seen and captured, if only the skyes were more interesting that day... other than that, great!</td>', 'Lovely composition verry interesting place well seen and captured, if only the skyes were more interesting that day... other than that, great!', '2004-04-29 16:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
