(691078, 71993, 10818, '<td valign="top">Thats beautiful...love the transitions from flowers, to old church, to village, to  hill and sky.  Great colors, and a great shot.</td>', 'Thats beautiful...love the transitions from flowers, to old church, to village, to  hill and sky.  Great colors, and a great shot.', '2004-04-29 20:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(691080, 71626, 10818, '<td valign="top">I looks like you have a wonderful town.  Lots of water, mountains.  I dont think the powerlines are the most interesting shot you could get in that town.</td>', 'I looks like you have a wonderful town.  Lots of water, mountains.  I dont think the powerlines are the most interesting shot you could get in that town.', '2004-04-29 20:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(691081, 71761, 10818, '<td valign="top">What beautiful water...so clear, and the ice and the mountains...its stunning.  Very nice.</td>', 'What beautiful water...so clear, and the ice and the mountains...its stunning.  Very nice.', '2004-04-29 20:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(691111, 72178, 6870, '<td valign="top">Hey, my brother lives here! Wait . . . are YOU my brother? Hmmm. If not, I''m coming up in a week or so. Wanna go shooting? I''ll be headed to the Bechler Falls area of Yellowstone, I think. Nice shot by the way. I like the centered compostion, bold colors and clear blue sky.</td>', 'Hey, my brother lives here! Wait . . . are YOU my brother? Hmmm. If not, I''m coming up in a week or so. Wanna go shooting? I''ll be headed to the Bechler Falls area of Yellowstone, I think. Nice shot by the way. I like the centered compostion, bold colors and clear blue sky.', '2004-04-29 21:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(691113, 72143, 6870, '<td valign="top">Striking clarity! Lovely colors.</td>', 'Striking clarity! Lovely colors.', '2004-04-29 21:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(691115, 72068, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun shot! What are those vertical lines going through the image in the field area? I think this is a great way to say "my town" because the town always rallies behind its sports team(s). NIce sunset feel to things, too.</td>', 'Fun shot! What are those vertical lines going through the image in the field area? I think this is a great way to say "my town" because the town always rallies behind its sports team(s). NIce sunset feel to things, too.', '2004-04-29 21:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(691116, 71728, 15495, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-04-29 21:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(691118, 72264, 6870, '<td valign="top">Ten. Yep. Very nice clarity, and the lightning adds to the shot. It''s a good shot without it, too.</td>', 'Ten. Yep. Very nice clarity, and the lightning adds to the shot. It''s a good shot without it, too.', '2004-04-29 21:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(691119, 72264, 15495, '<td valign="top">Dude ... Sweet</td>', 'Dude ... Sweet', '2004-04-29 21:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(691120, 72119, 6870, '<td valign="top">Superb tones here. Is this you, Jon? If not, take heart--Jon''s good! Composition and drama are very effective here. 10</td>', 'Superb tones here. Is this you, Jon? If not, take heart--Jon''s good! Composition and drama are very effective here. 10', '2004-04-29 21:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(691122, 72070, 6870, '<td valign="top">Classic shot, and I love the slightly high-key approach. 10</td>', 'Classic shot, and I love the slightly high-key approach. 10', '2004-04-29 21:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(691126, 72085, 6870, '<td valign="top">Perhaps oversharpened in the watery foreground--see the little digital noisy things? Also around the distant rock--see the white halo around it? Still, I wanna go here! Very nice image. Superb point of view here and exposure. 9</td>', 'Perhaps oversharpened in the watery foreground--see the little digital noisy things? Also around the distant rock--see the white halo around it? Still, I wanna go here! Very nice image. Superb point of view here and exposure. 9', '2004-04-29 21:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(691127, 72334, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m coming to sit with you awhile. When''s a good time? Just kidding. Really nice iamge. Composition is so effective and color are nice and saturated. 9</td>', 'I''m coming to sit with you awhile. When''s a good time? Just kidding. Really nice iamge. Composition is so effective and color are nice and saturated. 9', '2004-04-29 21:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(691128, 72260, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really superior work. Composition is right on and I love the misty look. Congratulations! 10</td>', 'Really superior work. Composition is right on and I love the misty look. Congratulations! 10', '2004-04-29 21:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(691129, 71123, 6870, '<td valign="top">Composition is so so nice! The extremes of sky really enhance this. I wish the figures were slightly more clear, but magnificent image. 10</td>', 'Composition is so so nice! The extremes of sky really enhance this. I wish the figures were slightly more clear, but magnificent image. 10', '2004-04-29 21:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(691130, 71871, 6870, '<td valign="top">Iowa? Some chicken state? I like the idea very much,and your composition is also good. I think this could say "my town" as many towns'' economies hinge on such production. They are ever so slightly out of focus, though, and the lighting is somewhat harsh. Still, I like this a lot!</td>', 'Iowa? Some chicken state? I like the idea very much,and your composition is also good. I think this could say "my town" as many towns'' economies hinge on such production. They are ever so slightly out of focus, though, and the lighting is somewhat harsh. Still, I like this a lot!', '2004-04-29 21:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(691133, 72053, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and point of view. It''s a bit out of focus. Shots like these in which color doesn''t play a large role may be interesting in black and white, too. Nice work.</td>', 'Very nice composition and point of view. It''s a bit out of focus. Shots like these in which color doesn''t play a large role may be interesting in black and white, too. Nice work.', '2004-04-29 21:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(691146, 72085, 8610, '<td valign="top">love the sharpnes and the details. Great scene</td>', 'love the sharpnes and the details. Great scene', '2004-04-29 22:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(691160, 71927, 18349, '<td valign="top">Whether it was by accident, coincidence, planning, or photoshop, the fuschia hat and baby''s outfit are perfect for this composition.  I adore this photo...it has a dreamy, fairy-tale like quality that I just love.  It does seem to be tilted down to the right a tad, and I wish the light were a tiny bit brighter on the girls, but I love it anyway.</td>', 'Whether it was by accident, coincidence, planning, or photoshop, the fuschia hat and baby''s outfit are perfect for this composition.  I adore this photo...it has a dreamy, fairy-tale like quality that I just love.  It does seem to be tilted down to the right a tad, and I wish the light were a tiny bit brighter on the girls, but I love it anyway.', '2004-04-29 22:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(691161, 72249, 18349, '<td valign="top">That''s my neck of the woods!  Darn those stupid radio towers, anyway.  Maybe clone them out and leave that skykline?  Great perspective on Big D.</td>', 'That''s my neck of the woods!  Darn those stupid radio towers, anyway.  Maybe clone them out and leave that skykline?  Great perspective on Big D.', '2004-04-29 22:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(691163, 71124, 18349, '<td valign="top">My only 10 this challenge.  What a great shot!  Absolutely stunning reflection and sky.  I won''t even mention the PS word, because it stirs so much fear into the hearts of those around us, but if any of it was retouched, it is perfectly fine with me because the result is stunning!</td>', 'My only 10 this challenge.  What a great shot!  Absolutely stunning reflection and sky.  I won''t even mention the PS word, because it stirs so much fear into the hearts of those around us, but if any of it was retouched, it is perfectly fine with me because the result is stunning!', '2004-04-29 22:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
