(691427, 71978, 18552, '<td valign="top">Hope you didn''t leave the girl and dog in the road for very long. An interesting idea but kind of dangerous.</td>', 'Hope you didn''t leave the girl and dog in the road for very long. An interesting idea but kind of dangerous.', '2004-04-30 04:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(691428, 72102, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture of suburban life, it really has a nice cozy feel to it. I think the red tulips would have been better more in the left corner instead of so much in the middle - they kind of steal the shot.</td>', 'Very nice picture of suburban life, it really has a nice cozy feel to it. I think the red tulips would have been better more in the left corner instead of so much in the middle - they kind of steal the shot.', '2004-04-30 04:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
