(691431, 72139, 18552, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture of a dandelion - great job of destaturating except for the flower. The photo seems to be more about the dandelion than where you live.</td>', 'Excellent picture of a dandelion - great job of destaturating except for the flower. The photo seems to be more about the dandelion than where you live.', '2004-04-30 04:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
