(691747, 72256, 16004, '<td valign="top">What a stylistically drab monstrosity this is!  Going duotone definitely appears to be a good move.  Personally, i might have been tempted to have chopped out the extreme bottom portion of the shot (the large area of black is quite overbearing).  However, that aside, i think this is a fine picture, and from the scenery in the background, it looks like you live in a great place.  8.</td>', 'What a stylistically drab monstrosity this is!  Going duotone definitely appears to be a good move.  Personally, i might have been tempted to have chopped out the extreme bottom portion of the shot (the large area of black is quite overbearing).  However, that aside, i think this is a fine picture, and from the scenery in the background, it looks like you live in a great place.  8.', '2004-04-30 12:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(691786, 71935, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours. Shame the background isn`t as pleasing to the eye as the foreground but still overall very good. 8</td>', 'Very nice colours. Shame the background isn`t as pleasing to the eye as the foreground but still overall very good. 8', '2004-04-30 12:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
