(691901, 72300, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun shot! My son came right over when he saw it to gawk at it. We have a town in Utah, Vernal, that touts dinosaurs, so I can see easily how such a photo can represent a town. It may be a bit dark, but dark is okay. Try just darkening the medium tones, then bring up the highlights as an experiment. Fun stuff.</td>', 'Fun shot! My son came right over when he saw it to gawk at it. We have a town in Utah, Vernal, that touts dinosaurs, so I can see easily how such a photo can represent a town. It may be a bit dark, but dark is okay. Try just darkening the medium tones, then bring up the highlights as an experiment. Fun stuff.', '2004-04-30 15:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(691902, 72102, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like your use of depth of field, here, with so much in focus. Though to be honest I don''t find the photo overly attractive, it DOES say ''suburbs'', so nice work.</td>', 'I like your use of depth of field, here, with so much in focus. Though to be honest I don''t find the photo overly attractive, it DOES say ''suburbs'', so nice work.', '2004-04-30 15:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
