(692038, 72042, 8860, '<td valign="top">It''s a striking image. I''m not sure what you''ve intended by the angry sky though. It''s quite heavy handed for what seems like a pleasant view, and the ''drama'' seems out of place here to me.<br/> <br/>It''s a good composition too, so I feel a bit frustrated by this.</td>', 'It''s a striking image. I''m not sure what you''ve intended by the angry sky though. It''s quite heavy handed for what seems like a pleasant view, and the ''drama'' seems out of place here to me. It''s a good composition too, so I feel a bit frustrated by this.', '2004-04-30 17:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(692048, 71993, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice viewpoint. The scene is a bit busy otherwise but I also like your DOF across the field. Strangely the church appears to be sunlit but the light looks quite flat elsewhere.</td>', 'Nice viewpoint. The scene is a bit busy otherwise but I also like your DOF across the field. Strangely the church appears to be sunlit but the light looks quite flat elsewhere.', '2004-04-30 17:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
