(692058, 72126, 8860, '<td valign="top">Ooh, I don''t know - it looks fine as it is.  ;)<br/> <br/>Beautiful picture, crisp, and well composed. I can just feel that heather under foot - reminds me of the North Yorkshire Moors.</td>', 'Ooh, I don''t know - it looks fine as it is.  ;) Beautiful picture, crisp, and well composed. I can just feel that heather under foot - reminds me of the North Yorkshire Moors.', '2004-04-30 17:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(692059, 72279, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene. A touch less sky and more foreground would have improved the composition.</td>', 'Lovely scene. A touch less sky and more foreground would have improved the composition.', '2004-04-30 17:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(692066, 72328, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice viewpoint but not a lot of interest otherwise. It lacks a key focal point to latch onto. Waiting for an early or late time of the day would have prevented the overexposure of the path and balustrade - and could have generated more atmosphere with warmer light.</td>', 'Nice viewpoint but not a lot of interest otherwise. It lacks a key focal point to latch onto. Waiting for an early or late time of the day would have prevented the overexposure of the path and balustrade - and could have generated more atmosphere with warmer light.', '2004-04-30 17:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(692067, 72264, 8860, '<td valign="top">Amazingly ''dark'' capture of the lightning while retaining plenty of detail in the foreground. There appears to be no ambient glow around the bolt at all. Interesting scene and structure.</td>', 'Amazingly ''dark'' capture of the lightning while retaining plenty of detail in the foreground. There appears to be no ambient glow around the bolt at all. Interesting scene and structure.', '2004-04-30 17:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(692068, 72136, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is stunning!</td>', 'This is stunning!', '2004-04-30 17:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(692071, 72170, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is a bit underexposed but it had me attentive. I didn''t notice the person immediately, but on closer viewing it does look a little staged. This individual is wearing clean trainers &amp; clothes, and has none of the usual apparel associated with a homeless person bedding down. <br/> <br/>Although it seems like picking nits, it does matter considering the point you''re making.</td>', 'This is a bit underexposed but it had me attentive. I didn''t notice the person immediately, but on closer viewing it does look a little staged. This individual is wearing clean trainers & clothes, and has none of the usual apparel associated with a homeless person bedding down.  Although it seems like picking nits, it does matter considering the point you''re making.', '2004-04-30 17:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(692072, 71670, 1024, '<td valign="top">you have the perfect DOF here, t he squirrel is completely in focus and the background is nicely blurred.  Great job.</td>', 'you have the perfect DOF here, t he squirrel is completely in focus and the background is nicely blurred.  Great job.', '2004-04-30 17:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(692074, 72133, 1024, '<td valign="top">This photo makes me smile, not sure why, but it does.  Good job!</td>', 'This photo makes me smile, not sure why, but it does.  Good job!', '2004-04-30 17:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(692075, 72138, 8860, '<td valign="top">Your title states the obvious! This is a great shot requiring no words. Lovely focus from front to back and an interesting view.<br/> <br/>Shooting into the light though has caused overexposure in the sky and peaks.</td>', 'Your title states the obvious! This is a great shot requiring no words. Lovely focus from front to back and an interesting view. Shooting into the light though has caused overexposure in the sky and peaks.', '2004-04-30 17:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(692076, 72338, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the mosly black and white works very well here.</td>', 'Very nice, the mosly black and white works very well here.', '2004-04-30 17:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(692079, 72252, 8860, '<td valign="top">Is this San Fran? Lighting is a bit dull and the interesting features at the top of this tower are lost (if it''s the fire hose nozzle monument!). It''s a strong angle though.</td>', 'Is this San Fran? Lighting is a bit dull and the interesting features at the top of this tower are lost (if it''s the fire hose nozzle monument!). It''s a strong angle though.', '2004-04-30 17:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(692080, 72245, 9581, '<td valign="top">nice highlights but why is it dark on the right</td>', 'nice highlights but why is it dark on the right', '2004-04-30 17:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(692089, 71978, 8860, '<td valign="top">That''s a bad bit of home building! As I always say - location, location, location!<br/> <br/>You are obviously quite deranged!  :)</td>', 'That''s a bad bit of home building! As I always say - location, location, location! You are obviously quite deranged!  :)', '2004-04-30 18:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(692133, 72070, 1519, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Love the composition and choice of black and white.  Would have liked more contrast so the train tracks and trees stand out more.The grainy look makes it seem like an old time photo, but I can''t decide if I like the grain or not.  Overall: 8</td>', 'Nicely done.  Love the composition and choice of black and white.  Would have liked more contrast so the train tracks and trees stand out more.The grainy look makes it seem like an old time photo, but I can''t decide if I like the grain or not.  Overall: 8', '2004-04-30 18:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(692136, 72002, 1519, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  Great composition with the boats in the front and the cityscape in the back.  Is it a hazy day?  The photo seems washed out above the boats.  Would like to see more saturation in the colors. Overall: 8</td>', 'I really like this photo.  Great composition with the boats in the front and the cityscape in the back.  Is it a hazy day?  The photo seems washed out above the boats.  Would like to see more saturation in the colors. Overall: 8', '2004-04-30 19:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(692138, 72229, 1519, '<td valign="top">Definitely creative and unique.  Interesting choice and I enjoyed looking at it.  Could be more sharp.  Maybe a different angel to fit more of the lighted sign and lamp in the picture with less of the background.  Would rather see complete darkness and not the trees or other lights in this background.  Overall: 8</td>', 'Definitely creative and unique.  Interesting choice and I enjoyed looking at it.  Could be more sharp.  Maybe a different angel to fit more of the lighted sign and lamp in the picture with less of the background.  Would rather see complete darkness and not the trees or other lights in this background.  Overall: 8', '2004-04-30 19:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(692140, 72230, 1519, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Looks very desolate.  Nice choice of black and white. Nice composition.  Definitely says in the country, but doesn''t really tell me enough about what makes your place special and unique. Not much to see besides a broken down fence.  Still, I like it and the photo is good.  Overall: 7</td>', 'I like it.  Looks very desolate.  Nice choice of black and white. Nice composition.  Definitely says in the country, but doesn''t really tell me enough about what makes your place special and unique. Not much to see besides a broken down fence.  Still, I like it and the photo is good.  Overall: 7', '2004-04-30 19:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(692147, 71123, 1519, '<td valign="top">Revisiting this photo.  Very nice composition.  I love how the sky is just enormous and beautiful and blue and you can see the water and the sand.  Love the colors.  Would like to see the people a little bit bigger because they look a little like ants, or if they were silhouettes, that would be nice. They just seem a bit cluttered.  Nice job.  Overall: 7</td>', 'Revisiting this photo.  Very nice composition.  I love how the sky is just enormous and beautiful and blue and you can see the water and the sand.  Love the colors.  Would like to see the people a little bit bigger because they look a little like ants, or if they were silhouettes, that would be nice. They just seem a bit cluttered.  Nice job.  Overall: 7', '2004-04-30 19:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(692150, 71124, 1519, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Love the buildings and the lights and the reflection of colors. Seems blurry, though.  Would have liked to see it more sharp.  Overall: 7</td>', 'Very pretty.  Love the buildings and the lights and the reflection of colors. Seems blurry, though.  Would have liked to see it more sharp.  Overall: 7', '2004-04-30 19:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(692153, 72250, 1519, '<td valign="top">Too blurry and I don''t feel like there is any real subject.  And I can''t tell what is on the right.</td>', 'Too blurry and I don''t feel like there is any real subject.  And I can''t tell what is on the right.', '2004-04-30 19:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(692159, 72284, 1519, '<td valign="top">I am revisiting this photo.  The title doesn''t tell me anything about where you live and I can''t tell from the picture.  The photo is neat, though, so I''ll raise my vote.  I like the water effect.  B/W is nice and so is composition.  Overall: 7</td>', 'I am revisiting this photo.  The title doesn''t tell me anything about where you live and I can''t tell from the picture.  The photo is neat, though, so I''ll raise my vote.  I like the water effect.  B/W is nice and so is composition.  Overall: 7', '2004-04-30 19:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(692161, 72254, 1519, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I like the subject.  Seems grainy, though, and I ''m not sure I like how the 2nd boat is partially cropped out.  Maybe better in color?</td>', 'Nice idea.  I like the subject.  Seems grainy, though, and I ''m not sure I like how the 2nd boat is partially cropped out.  Maybe better in color?', '2004-04-30 19:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(692163, 72093, 1519, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and colors.  Beautiful sky. Sharpness is ok.  Maybe you could zoom in a bit or crop out the buildings or stuff on the far right, they don''t add to the photo.  I find it strange that the landscape on the right tilts upward.</td>', 'Nice subject and colors.  Beautiful sky. Sharpness is ok.  Maybe you could zoom in a bit or crop out the buildings or stuff on the far right, they don''t add to the photo.  I find it strange that the landscape on the right tilts upward.', '2004-04-30 19:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(692164, 72322, 9668, '<td valign="top">I love the reflections! Very peaceful indeed. I like the birds in the reflection of the cute cottage. Nice place to live. Only thing I would change is having the white box (?) and black thing on the lawn to the left.</td>', 'I love the reflections! Very peaceful indeed. I like the birds in the reflection of the cute cottage. Nice place to live. Only thing I would change is having the white box (?) and black thing on the lawn to the left.', '2004-04-30 19:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(692165, 72126, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape. Great lighting, evening I presume, soft lighting. Interesting idea through the title.</td>', 'Nice landscape. Great lighting, evening I presume, soft lighting. Interesting idea through the title.', '2004-04-30 19:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(692167, 71715, 9668, '<td valign="top">Image seems to have a strange tilt, although it is flat.</td>', 'Image seems to have a strange tilt, although it is flat.', '2004-04-30 19:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(692169, 71672, 1519, '<td valign="top">Really neat view and composition!!  Love how the sun is giving off those light rings. Great in B/W. Would be nice if buildings were parallel.  I don''t feel like it really tells me where you live, though.  Overall: 8</td>', 'Really neat view and composition!!  Love how the sun is giving off those light rings. Great in B/W. Would be nice if buildings were parallel.  I don''t feel like it really tells me where you live, though.  Overall: 8', '2004-04-30 19:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(692184, 72234, 17065, '<td valign="top">Too bad the top of the trees are not visible. Very nice composition though!</td>', 'Too bad the top of the trees are not visible. Very nice composition though!', '2004-04-30 20:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(692262, 71124, 20204, '<td valign="top">Wow -</td>', 'Wow -', '2004-04-30 21:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(692272, 72049, 20204, '<td valign="top">This is a very striking building.  The way it''s cropped on the edges it feels a bit busy, or cramped...  Easy to say without knowing what''s on the edges, but something to consider.</td>', 'This is a very striking building.  The way it''s cropped on the edges it feels a bit busy, or cramped...  Easy to say without knowing what''s on the edges, but something to consider.', '2004-04-30 21:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(692277, 72106, 20204, '<td valign="top">Seems like a less steep angle for this picture might have better contrasted the iron gate and the background building.  The fence has a lot of interest, and may have benefitted from that position.</td>', 'Seems like a less steep angle for this picture might have better contrasted the iron gate and the background building.  The fence has a lot of interest, and may have benefitted from that position.', '2004-04-30 21:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(692279, 72085, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the way this picture has interest in every layer of depth, and in how it its DOF shows great detail on the gull''s rock, and the point in the mid-ground while fading out the far background.  Great control - I hope I can pull that off some day!</td>', 'I love the way this picture has interest in every layer of depth, and in how it its DOF shows great detail on the gull''s rock, and the point in the mid-ground while fading out the far background.  Great control - I hope I can pull that off some day!', '2004-04-30 21:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(692281, 72294, 20204, '<td valign="top">Would be nice to have a more scenic backdrop for this lovely hydrant.</td>', 'Would be nice to have a more scenic backdrop for this lovely hydrant.', '2004-04-30 21:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(692282, 72107, 20204, '<td valign="top">The sepia look definitely works for this picture - I like it!</td>', 'The sepia look definitely works for this picture - I like it!', '2004-04-30 21:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(692286, 71911, 20204, '<td valign="top">If yo could retake this without the mini-van in the frame it would completely change the feel of the picture, I think for the better.</td>', 'If yo could retake this without the mini-van in the frame it would completely change the feel of the picture, I think for the better.', '2004-04-30 21:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(692288, 71715, 20204, '<td valign="top">Feels like this image is tipped clockwise a bit.</td>', 'Feels like this image is tipped clockwise a bit.', '2004-04-30 21:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(692290, 72336, 20779, '<td valign="top">I love the balance, harmony and quiet beauty of this one. It caught my eye immediately with its clean lines and balanced colors.</td>', 'I love the balance, harmony and quiet beauty of this one. It caught my eye immediately with its clean lines and balanced colors.', '2004-04-30 21:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(692293, 72245, 20779, '<td valign="top">The mood is so unique, and it hits me perfectly.</td>', 'The mood is so unique, and it hits me perfectly.', '2004-04-30 21:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(692296, 72266, 5965, '<td valign="top">Talk about scale. They look like children''s toys.</td>', 'Talk about scale. They look like children''s toys.', '2004-04-30 21:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(692300, 71264, 5965, '<td valign="top">I love the deep saturation your achieved. It looks like an old kodachrome slide.</td>', 'I love the deep saturation your achieved. It looks like an old kodachrome slide.', '2004-04-30 21:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(692301, 72262, 20779, '<td valign="top">I love the color impact upfront and then being taken back and around so gracefully. Love this.</td>', 'I love the color impact upfront and then being taken back and around so gracefully. Love this.', '2004-04-30 21:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(692309, 72002, 20779, '<td valign="top">What fascinating lighting. What could have been so ordinary is instead breathtaking!</td>', 'What fascinating lighting. What could have been so ordinary is instead breathtaking!', '2004-04-30 22:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(692312, 72037, 5965, '<td valign="top">What an incredible action shot! The composition is spectacular. You caught a great moment that also happens to be a good example of where you live. Assuming of course you live somewhere near rodeos.</td>', 'What an incredible action shot! The composition is spectacular. You caught a great moment that also happens to be a good example of where you live. Assuming of course you live somewhere near rodeos.', '2004-04-30 22:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(692319, 71957, 20779, '<td valign="top">The best part of this is the contrast and lighting. For me, that keeps drawing my eye regardless of the actual scene. I like this very much becuase I keep wanting to look at it longer.</td>', 'The best part of this is the contrast and lighting. For me, that keeps drawing my eye regardless of the actual scene. I like this very much becuase I keep wanting to look at it longer.', '2004-04-30 22:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(692325, 71361, 5965, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture, but it feels like it has a greyish cast to it. Have you considered brightening it up a bit in Photoshop. I''d love to see the colors with a bit more intensity.</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture, but it feels like it has a greyish cast to it. Have you considered brightening it up a bit in Photoshop. I''d love to see the colors with a bit more intensity.', '2004-04-30 22:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(692329, 71993, 20779, '<td valign="top">If this is real, then I want to come visit! Beautiful balance of saturation, depth, and color.</td>', 'If this is real, then I want to come visit! Beautiful balance of saturation, depth, and color.', '2004-04-30 22:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(692330, 71124, 5965, '<td valign="top">What kind of settings did you use to get the lights so bright and crisp? When I try to take pictures of the NY skyline, I have some difficulty with this. Especially when the memorial 9/11 lights are going. The blue lights always come out looking slightly grey.</td>', 'What kind of settings did you use to get the lights so bright and crisp? When I try to take pictures of the NY skyline, I have some difficulty with this. Especially when the memorial 9/11 lights are going. The blue lights always come out looking slightly grey.', '2004-04-30 22:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(692336, 71123, 5965, '<td valign="top">I''m from Brooklyn Heights and I was wondering which beach this is. I''ve got some great Coney Island shots. This is a great shot because it''s not most people''s idea of Brooklyn.</td>', 'I''m from Brooklyn Heights and I was wondering which beach this is. I''ve got some great Coney Island shots. This is a great shot because it''s not most people''s idea of Brooklyn.', '2004-04-30 22:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(692344, 72042, 5965, '<td valign="top">The special effects make it look more like the gateway to the bowels of hell. I wonder what this says about your feelings for your home town.</td>', 'The special effects make it look more like the gateway to the bowels of hell. I wonder what this says about your feelings for your home town.', '2004-04-30 22:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(692354, 72139, 9668, '<td valign="top">I know it would be really hard to do, but I think it would be cool if the baby was holding the flower. I don''t think this shot could have been done with basic editing but it makes it stand out more. I don''t see why the title isn''t capitalized, but won''t affect my score. Interesting shot.</td>', 'I know it would be really hard to do, but I think it would be cool if the baby was holding the flower. I don''t think this shot could have been done with basic editing but it makes it stand out more. I don''t see why the title isn''t capitalized, but won''t affect my score. Interesting shot.', '2004-04-30 22:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(692359, 71826, 9668, '<td valign="top">Amazing sky! Nice dark to light blue gradient. Really offset by the brown of the mud flats below. I would like to see a main subject in this shot (for fun), but I do realize that the city is the main subject.</td>', 'Amazing sky! Nice dark to light blue gradient. Really offset by the brown of the mud flats below. I would like to see a main subject in this shot (for fun), but I do realize that the city is the main subject.', '2004-04-30 22:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
