(693616, 71201, 14986, '<td valign="top">For me, the photo would have been much more interesting without the sign.   There is enough interest with the white building, the trees, the tall buidling in the back, and the way the sun is lighting it.   Especially if you could have kept the bike rider.</td>', 'For me, the photo would have been much more interesting without the sign.   There is enough interest with the white building, the trees, the tall buidling in the back, and the way the sun is lighting it.   Especially if you could have kept the bike rider.', '2004-05-02 14:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
