(693619, 72230, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like the sense of movement this shot has from the leaning of the tall grass.   With the fence post going in the opposite diagonal, it''s a nice contrast.    Very good composition.   I think I might like it better with just a little more contrast to the tone.</td>', 'I really like the sense of movement this shot has from the leaning of the tall grass.   With the fence post going in the opposite diagonal, it''s a nice contrast.    Very good composition.   I think I might like it better with just a little more contrast to the tone.', '2004-05-02 14:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
