(694187, 71703, 9232, '<td valign="top">Border is a little too large for this shot.  It seems to me that you''ve captured to much "action" with all the angles that can reflect the sunlight; its difficult for me as a viewer to focus on a limited number of elements as the limbs, buds, sky and construction all seem to vie for attention.</td>', 'Border is a little too large for this shot.  It seems to me that you''ve captured to much "action" with all the angles that can reflect the sunlight; its difficult for me as a viewer to focus on a limited number of elements as the limbs, buds, sky and construction all seem to vie for attention.', '2004-05-03 00:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
