(694192, 72164, 9232, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene.  You selected a first rate subject and you shot it from a fantastic angle.  The border could be smaller but the photograph is superb for the challenge.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Lovely scene.  You selected a first rate subject and you shot it from a fantastic angle.  The border could be smaller but the photograph is superb for the challenge.  One of my favorites.', '2004-05-03 00:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(694197, 71731, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very insightful picture for the challenge. No guide book would ever portray small town life as a dead end but living in a tiny town myself - I know it can be very true.</td>', 'Very insightful picture for the challenge. No guide book would ever portray small town life as a dead end but living in a tiny town myself - I know it can be very true.', '2004-05-03 00:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(694198, 72037, 5705, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really show a city? But I guess it represents where you live..</td>', 'Doesn''t really show a city? But I guess it represents where you live..', '2004-05-03 00:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(694199, 71634, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great point of view</td>', 'Great point of view', '2004-05-03 00:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(694200, 72042, 9232, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I don''t like the red so much but it does make for an impressive effect.  The buildings seem far away when I focus on them but the color effects you used help to mask that distance.  Perhaps putting the bridge (lock?) higher so that it sits closer to a thirds line would help me with this.  Regardless of the scoring it is a unique approach (or at least one I haven''t seen in challenges in a long time).  Way to get out of the box on this one.</td>', 'Wow.  I don''t like the red so much but it does make for an impressive effect.  The buildings seem far away when I focus on them but the color effects you used help to mask that distance.  Perhaps putting the bridge (lock?) higher so that it sits closer to a thirds line would help me with this.  Regardless of the scoring it is a unique approach (or at least one I haven''t seen in challenges in a long time).  Way to get out of the box on this one.', '2004-05-03 00:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(694202, 72001, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beatiful vista--wish you had avoided including the railing though!</td>', 'Beatiful vista--wish you had avoided including the railing though!', '2004-05-03 00:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(694204, 72136, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very attractive picture - really like the color of the sky.</td>', 'Very attractive picture - really like the color of the sky.', '2004-05-03 00:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(694207, 72115, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is a very lovely house, if you live here you''re really lucky! To my eyes, it would have been nicer without being tilted and without the sight fisheye effect.</td>', 'This is a very lovely house, if you live here you''re really lucky! To my eyes, it would have been nicer without being tilted and without the sight fisheye effect.', '2004-05-03 00:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(694209, 72249, 18552, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture - the skyscrapers still manage to look big even from 30 miles away.</td>', 'Interesting picture - the skyscrapers still manage to look big even from 30 miles away.', '2004-05-03 00:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(694211, 72034, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really nice picture. I like the red door with the rest of the pic in B&amp;W. The door decoration doesn''t really suit such an elegant looking door.</td>', 'Really nice picture. I like the red door with the rest of the pic in B&W. The door decoration doesn''t really suit such an elegant looking door.', '2004-05-03 00:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(694212, 72053, 18552, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture. Slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Lovely picture. Slightly out of focus.', '2004-05-03 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(694215, 72331, 18552, '<td valign="top">Lovely, lovely picture - so crisp and colorful. Makes me wish I lived near the sea instead of in a dry place.</td>', 'Lovely, lovely picture - so crisp and colorful. Makes me wish I lived near the sea instead of in a dry place.', '2004-05-03 00:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(694217, 72223, 6477, '<td valign="top">a perfect image for a postcard :)<br/>it says a lot about the city, good luck</td>', 'a perfect image for a postcard :)it says a lot about the city, good luck', '2004-05-03 00:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(694233, 72119, 6870, '<td valign="top">Heida! You? I shoulda known! Sorry! Wow! one of my personal favorites (as usual).</td>', 'Heida! You? I shoulda known! Sorry! Wow! one of my personal favorites (as usual).', '2004-05-03 01:01:19.000000', NULL, 0),
