(695103, 72068, 3102, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for the kind words!  This park has only been open since 2001, and it really is an amazing place.  Readers Digest just rated it the best park in America in an article last week.  The view of the city is great, and it''s a super place to watch a game.<br/> <br/>Now if we only had a *team* to go along with the park, it would be perfect!</td>', 'Thanks to all for the kind words!  This park has only been open since 2001, and it really is an amazing place.  Readers Digest just rated it the best park in America in an article last week.  The view of the city is great, and it''s a super place to watch a game. Now if we only had a *team* to go along with the park, it would be perfect!', '2004-05-03 11:42:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(695270, 72336, 12252, '<td valign="top">FABULOUS! Just a wonderful, wonderful shot, and it''s so exciting to see a San Diegan (okay, an Oceansidian) take a big blue ribbon! You made me proud with this image!</td>', 'FABULOUS! Just a wonderful, wonderful shot, and it''s so exciting to see a San Diegan (okay, an Oceansidian) take a big blue ribbon! You made me proud with this image!', '2004-05-03 13:55:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(695435, 72085, 20168, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo!  Great control of detail in foreground while zooming in on the Rock in the background, while offering us the wonders of multi-colored ridges in the far background.  Some of the finest DOF work in this challenge!  Delighted you placed in the top 10.  In my mind, this photo should have been a ribbon winner.  Keep sending DP Challenge such wonders of the natural landscape!  Zoomdak rocks!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-03 14:11:59.</i></td>', 'Stunning photo!  Great control of detail in foreground while zooming in on the Rock in the background, while offering us the wonders of multi-colored ridges in the far background.  Some of the finest DOF work in this challenge!  Delighted you placed in the top 10.  In my mind, this photo should have been a ribbon winner.  Keep sending DP Challenge such wonders of the natural landscape!  Zoomdak rocks!', '2004-05-03 15:10:24.000000', '2004-05-03 15:11:59.000000', 0),
