(696730, 72164, 16636, '<td valign="top">This is Arlington Row in the village of Bibury and these cottages date back to the 16th century. Unfortunately there was a car parked just out of shot on the left hand side. So this restricted my composition somewhat, luckily there is a small mound which I stood on to give the very slight ''looking down the hill'' impression.<br/>Thanks again for everyones votes.</td>', 'This is Arlington Row in the village of Bibury and these cottages date back to the 16th century. Unfortunately there was a car parked just out of shot on the left hand side. So this restricted my composition somewhat, luckily there is a small mound which I stood on to give the very slight ''looking down the hill'' impression.Thanks again for everyones votes.', '2004-05-04 04:56:49.000000', NULL, 0),
