(696931, 71581, 21087, '<td valign="top">I like the beautiful weathered surface and how the varnish throws off those great reflections. But I''m a bit bothered by the slight arcing of the window frame. Looks like you got close with a wide angle lens? If so, a more more standard focal length would''ve worked better, I think...</td>', 'I like the beautiful weathered surface and how the varnish throws off those great reflections. But I''m a bit bothered by the slight arcing of the window frame. Looks like you got close with a wide angle lens? If so, a more more standard focal length would''ve worked better, I think...', '2004-05-04 10:59:20.000000', NULL, 0),
