(697363, 72336, 7322, '<td valign="top">Can I ask, what is cloning? I''ve seen this mentioned a few times. I was under the impression it was against the rules to remove objects from the original. How is this done without breaking the rules? <br/> <br/>I love this photo by the way.</td>', 'Can I ask, what is cloning? I''ve seen this mentioned a few times. I was under the impression it was against the rules to remove objects from the original. How is this done without breaking the rules?  I love this photo by the way.', '2004-05-04 16:40:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(697414, 72169, 6870, '<td valign="top">You know, I didn''t even THINK about making this one in color. But I looked at the original file, and it looks pretty good. I also found that this did in fact look a bit dark on some screens. My screen at home must be better than my screen at work.<br/> <br/>Again, thanks for comments, your suggestions for improvement really help!</td>', 'You know, I didn''t even THINK about making this one in color. But I looked at the original file, and it looks pretty good. I also found that this did in fact look a bit dark on some screens. My screen at home must be better than my screen at work. Again, thanks for comments, your suggestions for improvement really help!', '2004-05-04 17:26:05.000000', NULL, 0),
