(742751, 72256, 7322, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t a member during this challenge so I didn''t vote. I believe it was this challenge that decided me on becoming a member because I love where I live and would have loved to have entered this one. <br/> <br/>I like the various contrasts in this shot. First there is a thematic contrast between man built structures and natural structures, then there is the visual contrast of the peak of the building being constructed and the peaks of the mountains in the background. From this viewpoint the building looks larger than the mountains. Is this an intentional statement, I wonder, or just a happy accident. I love the inclusion of the Roman numerals, particularly the usage of  "X" as a title. Let ''em figure it out or not.</td>', 'I wasn''t a member during this challenge so I didn''t vote. I believe it was this challenge that decided me on becoming a member because I love where I live and would have loved to have entered this one.  I like the various contrasts in this shot. First there is a thematic contrast between man built structures and natural structures, then there is the visual contrast of the peak of the building being constructed and the peaks of the mountains in the background. From this viewpoint the building looks larger than the mountains. Is this an intentional statement, I wonder, or just a happy accident. I love the inclusion of the Roman numerals, particularly the usage of  "X" as a title. Let ''em figure it out or not.', '2004-05-30 18:08:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(744174, 71957, 11832, '<td valign="top">great shot, How did you get the sky to look so dramatic? <br/> <br/>you did a good job dodging and burning.</td>', 'great shot, How did you get the sky to look so dramatic?  you did a good job dodging and burning.', '2004-05-31 14:01:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(744276, 71957, 2780, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hsteg:</b></div><hr/><i> great shot, How did you get the sky to look so dramatic? <br/> <br/>you did a good job dodging and burning. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>How did I get the sky so dramatic? Well I don''t think I can take credit for what the sky looked like, hehe :) All I did was darken the top a tiny little bit using a very large burn brush in PS.</td>', 'Originally posted by hsteg: great shot, How did you get the sky to look so dramatic?  you did a good job dodging and burning.   How did I get the sky so dramatic? Well I don''t think I can take credit for what the sky looked like, hehe :) All I did was darken the top a tiny little bit using a very large burn brush in PS.', '2004-05-31 16:02:25.000000', NULL, 0),
